at, the dev server returns 500 on every request until it is restarted. This includes the timetable APIs, which can make them look broken when they are not.\n- **No login page.** `/login` returns 404, and `src/app/(auth)/` contains only `layout.tsx`. Users can only sign in through the API.\n\n## Recommendation\n\nSend SH-6 back to Dev for TASK-9 to TASK-16, then run this phase again. Once the seed (FR-41 to FR-44) exists, the re-run should drive a real browser:\n- Run `npx playwright install chromium`.\n- Render the editor drag, clash and toast flow, the student Today view, the parent child switch, and print preview.\n"}}}
