+","   \"status\": \"complete\",","-  \"findings\": [","+  \"method\": \"`next dev` on :3300 against the local Postgres (:5433, seeded users). Headless Chromium (Playwright chromium_headless_shell-1200) was run twice: Run A with the app's shipped Content-Security-Policy enforced, and Run B with `bypassCSP: true` to check the SH-1 code on its own. Test INVITE and PASSWORD_RESET tokens were created with createToken(). Afterwards teacher2's password hash and passwordChangedAt were restored, failedLoginCount was reset, and the test tokens were marked used. Screenshots are in artifacts/ui-verification/screenshots/ (csp-* = Run A, bypass-* = Run B). There is no figma-readiness.json, so the checks are against the PRD text only.\",","+  \"blockingIssues\": [","     {","-      \"requirementId\": \"FR-5\",","-      \"surface\": \"Bell schedule page /admin/timetable/periods\",","-      \"verdict\": \"FAIL\",","-      \"notes\": \"Rendered as an authenticated ADMIN on `next dev` (:3200): the route returned HTTP 404 (Next not-found page). page.tsx and BellScheduleEditor.tsx are missing. Only GET /api/periods works; it returned 200 {data:[]}.\"","+      \"id\": \"UIV-1\",","+      \"severity\": \"BLOCKER\",","+      \"summary\": \"The shipped CSP stops React from hydrating, so no client UI works in a real browser. This was already present before SH-1, but every SH-1 page depends on client UI.\",","+      \"detail\": \"next.config.js sends `script-src 'self'`. Chromium blocks Next's inline RSC/bootstrap scripts (console: 'Executing inline script violates the following Content Security Policy directive'). The pages server-render correctly but never hydrate. Sign-in, forgot-password, invite accept, reset, password change, the password toggle, the live checklist and the user menu all do nothing. QA reported the same blocker; it is confirmed here independently.\",","+      \"fix\": \"Use a nonce-based CSP set in middleware, or allow 'unsafe-inline' for scripts (plus 'unsafe-eval' in dev only).\"","     },","     {","-      \"requirementId\": \"FR-7\",","-      \"surface\": \"Teaching days ToggleButtons + confirm dialog (on /admin/timetable/periods)\",","-      \"verdict\": \"FAIL\",","-      \"notes\": \"Rendered as an authenticated ADMIN on `next dev` (:3200): the route returned HTTP 404 (Next not-found page). Backend only: GET /api/school-days returned 200 with Mon\\u2013Fri teaching and slotCount per day. There is no ToggleButton UI and no confirmation dialog.\"","-    },","+      \"id\": \"UIV-2\",","+      \"severity\": \"HIGH\",","+      \"summary\": \"Before hydration, the auth forms submit as native GET forms, which puts passwords in the URL and in the server log.\",","+      \"detail\": \"Run A: submitting /reset-password/[token] went to `/reset-password/<token>?password=LeakCheck2026z&confirm=LeakCheck2026z`. The next dev access log recorded the same query string. The forms have `name` attributes but no `method=\\\"post\\\"`. Under UIV-1 this happens on every submit. Even with a working CSP, it can still happen on slow networks before hydration.\",","+      \"fix\": \"Add method=\\\"post\\\" to the auth/password forms (TokenPasswordForm/SetPasswordForm, LoginForm, ForgotPasswordForm, ChangePasswordForm).\"","+    }","+  ],","+  \"findings\": [","     {","-      \"requirementId\": \"FR-15\",","-      \"surface\": \"Timetable editor /admin/timetable (view selector, entity picker, year selector)\",","+      \"requirementId\": \"FR-2\",","+      \"surface\": \"/login page (Card, email/password TextFields, show-password toggle, Alert, Sign in button)\",","       \"verdict\": \"FAIL\",","-      \"notes\": \"Rendered as an authenticated ADMIN on `next dev` (:3200): the route returned HTTP 404 (Next not-found page). TimetableEditor.tsx is missing.\"","+      \"notes\": \"Run A: the page renders correctly (MUI Card, SchoolHub logo, Email*/Password* fields, eye icon, SIGN IN button, 'Forgot your password?' link; see csp-login-error.png). It never hydrates, though (UIV-1), so the toggle and the signIn('credentials') submit do nothing. Run B: 1 Card, the toggle switches type password→text, and sign-in works.\"","     },","     {","-      \"requirementId\": \"FR-16\",","-      \"surface\": \"TimetableGrid (days \\u00d7 periods, greyed BREAK/LUNCH, filled-cell content)\",","+      \"requirementId\": \"FR-4\",","+      \"surface\": \"/login error Alert\",","       \"verdict\": \"FAIL\",","-      \"notes\": \"No source exists: no file under src/ implements it. src/components/TimetableGrid/ does not exist, and no page hosts the grid.\"","+      \"notes\": \"Run A: no Alert ever appears because the form never hydrates. Run B: a wrong password for parent@ shows the Alert 'Email or password is incorrect.' (bypass-login-fail.png). The locked and disabled messages were not exercised in the browser.\"","     },","     {","-      \"requirementId\": \"FR-17\",","-      \"surface\": \"Editor sidebar with 'placed N' counters + drop-to-place\",","+      \"requirementId\": \"FR-7\",","+      \"surface\": \"Post-sign-in redirect (callbackUrl)\",","       \"verdict\": \"FAIL\",","-      \"notes\": \"The host page /admin/timetable returns 404. No source exists: no file under src/ implements it.\"","+      \"notes\": \"Run A: users can't sign in at all (UIV-1). Run B: callbackUrl=https://evil.example.com/x lands on /dashboard, and callbackUrl=/account/security lands on /account/security. Both are correct.\"","     },","     {","-      \"requirementId\": \"FR-18\",","-      \"surface\": \"Drag-to-move / drag-out or Delete-to-remove + confirm Dialog\",","-      \"verdict\": \"FAIL\",","-      \"notes\": \"The host page returns 404. @dnd-kit/core 6.3.1 is installed but imported nowhere in src/.\"","+      \"requirementId\": \"FR-11\",","+      \"surface\": \"middleware redirect for unauthenticated (app) pages\",","+      \"verdict\": \"PASS\",","+      \"notes\": \"Run A (shipped CSP): /dashboard → /login?callbackUrl=%2Fdashboard, and /account/security → /login?callbackUrl=%2Faccount%2Fsecurity. After sign-out, /account/security redirects to login again (Run B). This is server-side, so the CSP doesn't affect it.\"","     },","     {","-      \"requirementId\": \"FR-19\",","-      \"surface\": \"Clash preview while dragging (red tint + icon + Tooltip)\",","+      \"requirementId\": \"FR-13\",","+      \"surface\": \"/invite/[token] page (invalid and valid states)\",","       \"verdict\": \"FAIL\",","-      \"notes\": \"The host page returns 404. No source exists: no file under src/ implements it. GET /api/timetable/availability exists.\"","+      \"notes\": \"Server-rendered states are correct in both runs. An invalid token shows 'This invitation link is invalid or has expired. Ask the school office to send a new one.' with no sign-up link. A valid token shows 'Welcome to SchoolHub', read-only Name 'Ivy Invited' and Email 'invited@schoolhub.test', password and confirm fields, the checklist, and ACTIVATE ACCOUNT. FAIL because accepting is impossible in Run A (UIV-1), and a submit leaks the password into the URL (UIV-2). In Run B, submitting the invite was not exercised, to avoid activating the seed's INVITED user.\"","     },","     {","-      \"requirementId\": \"FR-20\",","-      \"surface\": \"Snap-back + error toast listing details.clashes[]\",","+      \"requirementId\": \"FR-16\",","+      \"surface\": \"PasswordChecklist on invite, reset and /account/security\",","       \"verdict\": \"FAIL\",","-      \"notes\": \"The host page returns 404. No source exists: no file under src/ implements it.\"","+      \"notes\": \"Present on all three pages with the 4 rules: 10–128 characters, a letter, a number, not the email. Run A: it stays static, because there is no hydration. Run B: it updates live. Typing 'abc1' marks letter, number and not-email as met (green check) and length as unmet (empty circle) (bypass-security-checklist.png).\"","     },","     {","-      \"requirementId\": \"FR-21\",","-      \"surface\": \"Room-change Popover with free-room Autocomplete\",","+      \"requirementId\": \"FR-17\",","+      \"surface\": \"/forgot-password page\",","       \"verdict\": \"FAIL\",","-      \"notes\": \"The host page returns 404. No source exists: no file under src/ implements it. GET /api/timetable/free-rooms exists.\"","+      \"notes\": \"Renders the email field, SEND RESET LINK and 'Back to sign in'. Run A: submit does nothing (UIV-1/UIV-2). Run B: an unknown email shows \\\"If an account exists for that email, we've sent a reset link.\\\" (bypass-forgot-done.png). The rate-limit message was not exercised.\"","     },","     {","-      \"requirementId\": \"FR-22\",","-      \"surface\": \"Keyboard 'Place course' Dialog on focused empty cell\",","+      \"requirementId\": \"FR-19\",","+      \"surface\": \"/reset-password/[token] page + /login success toast\",","       \"verdict\": \"FAIL\",","-      \"notes\": \"The host page returns 404. No source exists: no file under src/ implements it.\"","+      \"notes\": \"Invalid token: 'This link is invalid or has expired.' plus a 'Request a new reset link' link (both runs). Valid token: read-only Email, new and confirm fields, the checklist, and SET NEW PASSWORD. Run A: submitting does a native GET and the password lands in the URL and the server log (UIV-2). The reset does not happen. Run B: it redirects to /login?reset=1 and shows the toast 'Password updated. Sign in with your new password.' (bypass-reset-done-login.png). A minor dev-only hydration warning ('Extra attributes from the server: style' on an input) appears on this page.\"","     },","     {","-      \"requirementId\": \"FR-23\",","-      \"surface\": \"dnd-kit + MUI Paper/Card/Chip/Tooltip composition\",","+      \"requirementId\": \"FR-20\",","+      \"surface\": \"/account/security page\",","       \"verdict\": \"FAIL\",","-      \"notes\": \"Nothing to inspect: no grid or card components exist, and @dnd-kit/core is never imported.\"","+      \"notes\": \"Can't be reached through the UI in Run A, because sign-in needs hydration. Run B: the shell layout shows the heading 'Account security', the helper text, Current/New/Confirm fields with visibility toggles, the checklist, and UPDATE PASSWORD. A wrong current password shows the field error 'Current password is incorrect.' (bypass-security-wrong-current.png). The successful change and 'Password updated' toast were not exercised, to avoid changing seeded credentials.\"","     },","     {","-      \"requirementId\": \"FR-24\",","-      \"surface\": \"Personal timetable /timetable (read-only grid, current-period highlight)\",","+      \"requirementId\": \"FR-21\",","+      \"surface\": \"Top-bar user menu 'Account security' item\",","       \"verdict\": \"FAIL\",","-      \"notes\": \"Rendered as an authenticated ADMIN on `next dev` (:3200): the route returned HTTP 404 (Next not-found page). PersonalTimetable.tsx is missing.\"","+      \"notes\": \"Run A: the menu can't open (no hydration). Run B: the menu shows 'Account security' with a lock icon, linking to /account/security (bypass-user-menu.png).\"","     },","     {","       \"requirementId\": \"FR-25\",","-      \"surface\": \"Parent child selector on /timetable\",","-      \"verdict\": \"FAIL\",","-      \"notes\": \"/timetable returns 404. No source exists: no file under src/ implements it.\"","+      \"surface\": \"App shell uses the session user (no PLACEHOLDER_USER)\",","+      \"verdict\": \"PASS\",","+      \"notes\": \"Run B: the server-rendered shell shows avatar initials 'AA' for admin@ (Alice Admin), and the student's dashboard shows the student's data. layout.tsx passes requirePageUser() into AppShell, and PLACEHOLDER_USER no longer exists in shell.tsx. This markup is server-rendered, so the CSP doesn't change it, but reaching it in a real browser still depends on UIV-1.\"","     },","     {","       \"requirementId\": \"FR-26\",","-      \"surface\": \"Week/Today toggle + Today list with Now/Next badges\",","+      \"surface\": \"User menu: name, role badge, initials, Sign out\",","       \"verdict\": \"FAIL\",","-      \"notes\": \"/timetable returns 404. Only the nowAndNext helper exists, and it is not used by any UI.\"","+      \"notes\": \"Avatar 'AA' renders server-side. Run A: the menu can't open and Sign out can't be clicked. Run B: the menu shows 'Alice Admin', an 'ADMIN' Chip, Account security and Sign out. Sign out goes to /login, and the session is gone afterwards.\"","     },","     {","       \"requirementId\": \"FR-27\",","-      \"surface\": \"Student 'Timetable' tab /students/[id]/timetable\",","-      \"verdict\": \"FAIL\",","-      \"notes\": \"Checked in the source. The page was not rendered because the dev DB has no students. src/config/student-tabs.ts lists only 'courses', and src/app/(app)/students/[id]/ contains only courses/.\"","-    },","-    {","-      \"requirementId\": \"FR-28\",","-      \"surface\": \"Course 'Schedule' tab /courses/[courseId]/schedule\",","-      \"verdict\": \"FAIL\",","-      \"notes\": \"Checked in the source. The page was not rendered because the dev DB has no courses. src/config/course-tabs.ts lists only 'overview' and 'roster', and there is no schedule/ route directory.\"","-    },","-    {","-      \"requirementId\": \"FR-29\",","-      \"surface\": \"Print button + @media print A4 landscape layout\",","-      \"verdict\": \"FAIL\",","-      \"notes\": \"No grid view exists to print. PrintButton.tsx and TimetablePrintStyles.tsx are missing.\"","-    },","-    {","-      \"requirementId\": \"FR-32\",","-      \"surface\": \"Navigation entries: Timetable, Timetable editor, Bell schedule\",","-      \"verdict\": \"FAIL\",","-      \"notes\": \"src/config/navigation.ts has no timetable entries (Dashboard, Notifications, My courses, Email log, Sections and Courses only). The rendered /dashboard HTML contains no 'Timetable' or 'Bell schedule' text.\"","-    },","-    {","-      \"requirementId\": \"NFR-4\",","-      \"surface\": \"Accessibility: keyboard alternative, non-colour clash and Now/Next signals\",","-      \"verdict\": \"FAIL\",","-      \"notes\": \"There is no UI to check. It depends on FR-19, FR-22 and FR-26, which are all missing.\"","-    },","-    {","-      \"requirementId\": \"NFR-16\",","-      \"surface\": \"Cross-browser + print output\",","-      \"verdict\": \"BLOCKED\",","-      \"notes\": \"Could not check: there is no UI or print output, and no browser was driven. The chromium revision mismatch noted in earlier phases still applies.\"","+      \"surface\": \"Sidebar navigation filtered by session role\",","+      \"verdict\": \"PASS\",","+      \"notes\": \"Run B: ADMIN sees Dashboard, Notifications, Email log, then under Administration, Sections and Courses. STUDENT sees Dashboard, Notifications, My courses. The filtering is server-rendered; the same reachability caveat (UIV-1) applies.\"","     }","   ],","-  \"blockedReason\": null,","-  \"summary\": {","-    \"total\": 20,","-    \"pass\": 0,","-    \"fail\": 19,","-    \"blocked\": 1","-  },","-  \"environment\": {","-    \"server\": \"npx next dev -p 3200 (existing 'dev' script), local Postgres :5433\",","-    \"auth\": \"A temporary ADMIN (uiv-sh6@test.local) signed in through next-auth credentials and was deleted afterwards.\",","-    \"designReference\": null,","-    \"preExistingIssues\": [","-      \"@mui/x-internals 9.15.0 vs @mui/x-data-grid 9.5.0: /admin/sections returns 500, and afterwards the dev server answers 500 on every request until restarted. This predates SH-6.\",","-      \"GET /login returns 404 and src/app/(auth) contains only layout.tsx. This predates SH-6.\"","-    ]","-  }","-}","\\ No newline at end of file","+  \"blockedReason\": null","+}"]}],"originalFile":"{\n  \"ticketId\": \"SH-6\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-05T05:36:59Z\",\n  \"phase\": \"ui-verification\",\n  \"version\": \"1.0\",\n  \"status\": \"complete\",\n  \"findings\": [\n    {\n      \"re