 404. @dnd-kit/core 6.3.1 is installed but imported nowhere in src/.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"requirementId\": \"FR-19\",\n      \"surface\": \"Clash preview while dragging (red tint + icon + Tooltip)\",\n      \"verdict\": \"FAIL\",\n      \"notes\": \"The host page returns 404. No source exists: no file under src/ implements it. GET /api/timetable/availability exists.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"requirementId\": \"FR-20\",\n      \"surface\": \"Snap-back + error toast listing details.clashes[]\",\n      \"verdict\": \"FAIL\",\n      \"notes\": \"The host page returns 404. No source exists: no file under src/ implements it.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"requirementId\": \"FR-21\",\n      \"surface\": \"Room-change Popover with free-room Autocomplete\",\n      \"verdict\": \"FAIL\",\n      \"notes\": \"The host page returns 404. No source exists: no file under src/ implements it. GET /api/timetable/free-rooms exists.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"requirementId\": \"FR-22\",\n      \"surface\": \"Keyboard 'Place course' Dialog on focused empty cell\",\n      \"verdict\": \"FAIL\",\n      \"notes\": \"The host page returns 404. No source exists: no file under src/ implements it.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"requirementId\": \"FR-23\",\n      \"surface\": \"dnd-kit + MUI Paper/Card/Chip/Tooltip composition\",\n      \"verdict\": \"FAIL\",\n      \"notes\": \"Nothing to inspect: no grid or card components exist, and @dnd-kit/core is never imported.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"requirementId\": \"FR-24\",\n      \"surface\": \"Personal timetable /timetable (read-only grid, current-period highlight)\",\n      \"verdict\": \"FAIL\",\n      \"notes\": \"Rendered as an authenticated ADMIN on `next dev` (:3200): the route returned HTTP 404 (Next not-found page). PersonalTimetable.tsx is missing.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"requirementId\": \"FR-25\",\n      \"surface\": \"Parent child selector on /timetable\",\n      \"verdict\": \"FAIL\",\n      \"notes\": \"/timetable returns 404. No source exists: no file under src/ implements it.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"requirementId\": \"FR-26\",\n      \"surface\": \"Week/Today toggle + Today list with Now/Next badges\",\n      \"verdict\": \"FAIL\",\n      \"notes\": \"/timetable returns 404. Only the nowAndNext helper exists, and it is not used by any UI.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"requirementId\": \"FR-27\",\n      \"surface\": \"Student 'Timetable' tab /students/[id]/timetable\",\n      \"verdict\": \"FAIL\",\n      \"notes\": \"Checked in the source. The page was not rendered because the dev DB has no students. src/config/student-tabs.ts lists only 'courses', and src/app/(app)/students/[id]/ contains only courses/.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"requirementId\": \"FR-28\",\n      \"surface\": \"Course 'Schedule' tab /courses/[courseId]/schedule\",\n      \"verdict\": \"FAIL\",\n      \"notes\": \"Checked in the source. The page was not rendered because the dev DB has no courses. src/config/course-tabs.ts lists only 'overview' and 'roster', and there is no schedule/ route directory.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"requirementId\": \"FR-29\",\n      \"surface\": \"Print button + @media print A4 landscape layout\",\n      \"verdict\": \"FAIL\",\n      \"notes\": \"No grid view exists to print. PrintButton.tsx and TimetablePrintStyles.tsx are missing.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"requirementId\": \"FR-32\",\n      \"surface\": \"Navigation entries: Timetable, Timetable editor, Bell schedule\",\n      \"verdict\": \"FAIL\",\n      \"notes\": \"src/config/navigation.ts has no timetable entries (Dashboard, Notifications, My courses, Email log, Sections and Courses only). The rendered /dashboard HTML contains no 'Timetable' or 'Bell schedule' text.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"requirementId\": \"NFR-4\",\n      \"surface\": \"Accessibility: keyboard alternative, non-colour clash and Now/Next signals\",\n      \"verdict\": \"FAIL\",\n      \"notes\": \"There is no UI to check. It depends on FR-19, FR-22 and FR-26, which are all missing.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"requirementId\": \"NFR-16\",\n      \"surface\": \"Cross-browser + print output\",\n      \"verdict\": \"BLOCKED\",\n      \"notes\": \"Could not check: there is no UI or print output, and no browser was driven. The chromium revision mismatch noted in earlier phases still applies.\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"blockedReason\": null,\n  \"summary\": {\n    \"total\": 20,\n    \"pass\": 0,\n    \"fail\": 19,\n    \"blocked\": 1\n  },\n  \"environment\": {\n    \"server\": \"npx next dev -p 3200 (existing 'dev' script), local Postgres :5433\",\n    \"auth\": \"A temporary ADMIN (uiv-sh6@test.local) signed in through next-auth credentials and was deleted afterwards.\",\n    \"designReference\": null,\n    \"preExistingIssues\": [\n      \"@mui/x-internals 9.15.0 vs @mui/x-data-grid 9.5.0: /admin/sections returns 500, and afterwards the dev server answers 500 on every request until restarted. This predates SH-6.\",\n      \"GET /login returns 404 and src/app/(auth) contains only layout.tsx. This predates SH-6.\"\n    ]\n  }\n}","userModified":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01JhS3WMbccA1yoGKrApJS5u","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgkAisLMbTtNCJUPjmxCb","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_019hMxuHeqPeis77YidJNhUS","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/Users/ikramaansari/Documents/forge/schoolhub/artifacts/ui-verification/ui-verification-report.md","content":"# UI Verification — SH-1 (PRD-01 Authentication, Sessions & RBAC)\n\n**Status:** complete · **Result:** 3 PASS / 10 FAIL / 0 BLOCKED\n\n## How it was verified\n\n- **App:** `next dev` on :3300 against the local Postgres (:5433, seeded users). Headless Chromium was run twice:\n  - **Run A:** with the app's shipped Content-Security-Policy enforced (the real user experience).\n  - **Run B:** with `bypassCSP: true`, to check the SH-1 code on its own.\n- **Test data:** INVITE and PASSWORD_RESET tokens were created with `createToken()`. Afterwards:\n  - teacher2's password hash and `passwordChangedAt` were restored;\n  - failed-login counters were reset;\n  - the test tokens were marked used.\n- **Design reference:** there is no `figma-readiness.json`, so the checks are against the PRD text only.\n- **Screenshots:** `artifacts/ui-verification/screenshots/`. `csp-*` files are from Run A and `bypass-*` files are from Run B.\n\n## Blocking issues\n\n1. **UIV-1 · BLOCKER: the shipped CSP stops hydration.**\n   - `next.config.js` sends `script-src 'self'`, and Chromium blocks Next's inline scripts.\n   - Every page server-renders correctly but stays non-interactive. Sign-in, the password toggle, the checklist, the user menu and every form submit do nothing.\n   - This was already present before SH-1, and QA reported it too; it is confirmed here independently.\n   - **Fix:** a nonce-based CSP set in middleware, or `'unsafe-inline'` for scripts (plus `'unsafe-eval'` in dev only).\n2. **UIV-2 · HIGH: passwords leak into the URL before hydration.**\n   - The forms have no `method=\"post\"`, so an unhydrated submit becomes a native GET.\n   - Run A produced `/reset-password/<token>?password=LeakCheck2026z&confirm=LeakCheck2026z`, and the dev server's access log recorded the same query string.\n   - **Fix:** add `method=\"post\"` to LoginForm, ForgotPasswordForm, SetPasswordForm/TokenPasswordForm and ChangePasswordForm.\n\nWith CSP bypassed (Run B), every SH-1 surface behaves as the PRD describes. Fixing UIV-1 and UIV-2 should turn most FAILs below into PASS.\n\n## Findings\n\n| Req | Surface | Verdict | Notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| FR-2 | `/login` | FAIL | Renders correctly: Card, fields, eye toggle, Sign in button, \"Forgot your password?\" link. It does not hydrate in Run A. In Run B the toggle and sign-in work. |\n| FR-4 | `/login` error Alert | FAIL | Run A shows no Alert. Run B shows \"Email or password is incorrect.\" Locked and disabled messages were not exercised. |\n| FR-7 | callbackUrl redirect | FAIL | Users can't sign in in Run A. In Run B, an external callbackUrl goes to `/dashboard` and `/account/security` is honoured. |\n| FR-11 | middleware redirect | **PASS** | `/dashboard` → `/login?callbackUrl=%2Fdashboard` with CSP enforced. This is server-side. |\n| FR-13 | `/invite/[token]` | FAIL | The invalid and valid states render correctly: exact invalid-link copy, read-only name and email, checklist, Activate account. Accepting is impossible in Run A, and a submit would leak the password (UIV-2). Accepting was not exercised in Run B, to avoid activating the seeded invite user. |\n| FR-16 | PasswordChecklist | FAIL | Present on the invite, reset and security pages with all 4 rules. It is static in Run A. In Run B it updates live: for \"abc1\", letter, number and not-email are met and length is unmet. |\n| FR-17 | `/forgot-password` | FAIL | Renders correctly. In Run B, an unknown email shows the message that doesn't reveal whether the account exists. In Run A, submit does nothing. |\n| FR-19 | `/reset-password/[token]` | FAIL | The invalid state shows the copy plus a \"Request a new reset link\" link. Run A: the password leaked into the URL and the log, and no reset happened. Run B: redirect to `/login?reset=1` and the toast \"Password updated. Sign in with your new password.\" Minor: a dev-only hydration warning appears on this page. |\n| FR-20 | `/account/security` | FAIL | Not reachable through the UI in Run A. In Run B the fields, toggles and checklist render, and a wrong current password shows \"Current password is incorrect.\" The successful change was not exercised. |\n| FR-21 | Menu \"Account security\" | FAIL | The menu can't open in Run A. In Run B the item is present with a lock icon and links correctly. |\n| FR-25 | Shell uses the session user | **PASS** | Server-rendered initials \"AA\" for Alice Admin. PLACEHOLDER_USER is gone. |\n| FR-26 | User menu name/badge/sign out | FAIL | The avatar renders, but the menu can't open in Run A. In Run B it shows \"Alice Admin\", an ADMIN chip and Sign out, and Sign out goes to `/login` with the session cleared. |\n| FR-27 | Role-filtered sidebar | **PASS** | ADMIN sees Dashboard, Notifications, Email log, Sections, Courses. STUDENT sees Dashboard, Notifications, My courses. |\n\n## Side effects to know about\n\n- Creating a test INVITE token for `invited@schoolhub.test` invalidated the invite link the seed logged earlier. Re-run `npm run db:seed` to get a fresh link.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3572,"cache_read_input_tokens":73565,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3572},"output_tokens":16,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"fec0918a-90f0-4d65-82e8-8c5873335661","uuid":"cd97dd14-b895-440b-ac65-fc01fb4c7812","timestamp":"2026-11-05T17:23:12.580Z","request_id":"req_011CgkAis5Dw5cysvriT