ength is unmet. |\n| FR-17 | `/forgot-password` | FAIL | Renders correctly. In Run B, an unknown email shows the message that doesn't reveal whether the account exists. In Run A, submit does nothing. |\n| FR-19 | `/reset-password/[token]` | FAIL | The invalid state shows the copy plus a \"Request a new reset link\" link. Run A: the password leaked into the URL and the log, and no reset happened. Run B: redirect to `/login?reset=1` and the toast \"Password updated. Sign in with your new password.\" Minor: a dev-only hydration warning appears on this page. |\n| FR-20 | `/account/security` | FAIL | Not reachable through the UI in Run A. In Run B the fields, toggles and checklist render, and a wrong current password shows \"Current password is incorrect.\" The successful change was not exercised. |\n| FR-21 | Menu \"Account security\" | FAIL | The menu can't open in Run A. In Run B the item is present with a lock icon and links correctly. |\n| FR-25 | Shell uses the session user | **PASS** | Server-rendered initials \"AA\" for Alice Admin. PLACEHOLDER_USER is gone. |\n| FR-26 | User menu name/badge/sign out | FAIL | The avatar renders, but the menu can't open in Run A. In Run B it shows \"Alice Admin\", an ADMIN chip and Sign out, and Sign out goes to `/login` with the session cleared. |\n| FR-27 | Role-filtered sidebar | **PASS** | ADMIN sees Dashboard, Notifications, Email log, Sections, Courses. STUDENT sees Dashboard, Notifications, My courses. |\n\n## Side effects to know about\n\n- Creating a test INVITE token for `invited@schoolhub.test` invalidated the invite link the seed logged earlier. Re-run `npm run db:seed` to get a fresh link.\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":1,"oldLines":65,"newStart":1,"newLines":51,"lines":["-# UI Verification Report: SH-6 (PRD-06 Bell Schedule & Timetable)","+# UI Verification — SH-1 (PRD-01 Authentication, Sessions & RBAC)"," ","-- **ticketId:** SH-6","-- **timestamp:** 2026-11-05T05:36:59Z","-- **status:** complete (the verification ran, and the UI is absent)","-- **Result:** 0 PASS, 19 FAIL, 1 BLOCKED, out of 20 UI-facing requirements","-- **Design reference:** none (there is no `figma-readiness.json`). The checks compare against the PRD text in `requirements.json`.","+**Status:** complete · **Result:** 3 PASS / 10 FAIL / 0 BLOCKED"," ","-## Headline","+## How it was verified"," ","-**None of the SH-6 UI exists.** Every timetable page was rendered as a signed-in ADMIN, and each one returned **HTTP 404**. The checks were:","-- `/timetable`","-- `/admin/timetable`","-- `/admin/timetable/periods`","+- **App:** `next dev` on :3300 against the local Postgres (:5433, seeded users). Headless Chromium was run twice:","+  - **Run A:** with the app's shipped Content-Security-Policy enforced (the real user experience).","+  - **Run B:** with `bypassCSP: true`, to check the SH-1 code on its own.","+- **Test data:** INVITE and PASSWORD_RESET tokens were created with `createToken()`. Afterwards:","+  - teacher2's password hash and `passwordChangedAt` were restored;","+  - failed-login counters were reset;","+  - the test tokens were marked used.","+- **Design reference:** there is no `figma-readiness.json`, so the checks are against the PRD text only.","+- **Screenshots:** `artifacts/ui-verification/screenshots/`. `csp-*` files are from Run A and `bypass-*` files are from Run B."," ","-This confirms the QA finding: Dev stopped after TASK-8, the backend. TASK-9 to TASK-14 (grid, bell schedule, editor, personal, student and course views, navigation) were never built.","+## Blocking issues"," ","-The backend that the UI would use does respond:","-- `GET /api/periods` returns 200 `{data:[]}`. It is empty because the seed (TASK-15) was not built either.","-- `GET /api/school-days` returns 200, with Mon–Fri teaching and a `slotCount` for each day.","+1. **UIV-1 · BLOCKER: the shipped CSP stops hydration.**","+   - `next.config.js` sends `script-src 'self'`, and Chromium blocks Next's inline scripts.","+   - Every page server-renders correctly but stays non-interactive. Sign-in, the password toggle, the checklist, the user menu and every form submit do nothing.","+   - This was already present before SH-1, and QA reported it too; it is confirmed here independently.","+   - **Fix:** a nonce-based CSP set in middleware, or `'unsafe-inline'` for scripts (plus `'unsafe-eval'` in dev only).","+2. **UIV-2 · HIGH: passwords leak into the URL before hydration.**","+   - The forms have no `method=\"post\"`, so an unhydrated submit becomes a native GET.","+   - Run A produced `/reset-password/<token>?password=LeakCheck2026z&confirm=LeakCheck2026z`, and the dev server's access log recorded the same query string.","+   - **Fix:** add `method=\"post\"` to LoginForm, ForgotPasswordForm, SetPasswordForm/TokenPasswordForm and ChangePasswordForm."," ","-## How it was checked","+With CSP bypassed (Run B), every SH-1 surface behaves as the PRD describes. Fixing UIV-1 and UIV-2 should turn most FAILs below into PASS."," ","-1. Started the project's own dev server (`npx next dev -p 3200`) against the local Postgres on :5433.","-2. Created a temporary ADMIN `uiv-sh6@test.local` and signed in through the next-auth credentials callback.","-3. Requested each route. The temporary user and its audit rows were deleted afterwards, and the dev server was stopped.","-4. Pages that cannot be reached without seed data (the student and course tabs) were checked against the route files and the tab registries in the source instead. These are marked FAIL, not PASS, because the code is provably missing.","-"," ## Findings"," "," | Req | Surface | Verdict | Notes |"," |---|---|---|---|","-| FR-5 | Bell schedule `/admin/timetable/periods` | FAIL | 404. `page.tsx` and `BellScheduleEditor.tsx` are missing. |","-| FR-7 | Teaching-day ToggleButtons + confirm | FAIL | 404. Only the API exists (it returns slotCount per day). |","-| FR-15 | Timetable editor `/admin/timetable` | FAIL | 404. `TimetableEditor.tsx` is missing. |","-| FR-16 | TimetableGrid | FAIL | `src/components/TimetableGrid/` does not exist. |","-| FR-17 | Sidebar \"placed N\" + drop to place | FAIL | The host page returns 404, and the code is missing. |","-| FR-18 | Drag move / remove + confirm | FAIL | The host page returns 404. `@dnd-kit/core` is never imported. |","-| FR-19 | Clash tint + icon + tooltip | FAIL | The host page returns 404. The availability API exists. |","-| FR-20 | Snap-back + clash toast | FAIL | The host page returns 404, and the code is missing. |","-| FR-21 | Room Popover (free rooms) | FAIL | The host page returns 404. The free-rooms API exists. |","-| FR-22 | Keyboard \"Place course\" dialog | FAIL | The host page returns 404, and the code is missing. |","-| FR-23 | dnd-kit + MUI Paper/Card/Chip | FAIL | No components to inspect. |","-| FR-24 | Personal `/timetable` | FAIL | 404. `PersonalTimetable.tsx` is missing. |","-| FR-25 | Parent child selector | FAIL | `/timetable` returns 404. |","-| FR-26 | Week/Today + Now/Next badges | FAIL | `/timetable` returns 404. The `nowAndNext` helper exists but no UI uses it. |","-| FR-27 | Student \"Timetable\" tab | FAIL | `student-tabs.ts` has only `courses`, and the route directory does not exist. |","-| FR-28 | Course \"Schedule\" tab | FAIL | `course-tabs.ts` has only `overview` and `roster`, and there is no `schedule/` route. |","-| FR-29 | Print button + A4 print layout | FAIL | There is no grid to print, and the print components are missing. |","-| FR-32 | Nav entries (Timetable / editor / Bell schedule) | FAIL | Not in `navigation.ts` or the rendered dashboard HTML. |","-| NFR-4 | Accessibility signals | FAIL | Depends on FR-19, FR-22 and FR-26, which are all missing. |","-| NFR-16 | Cross-browser + print output | BLOCKED | There is no UI to check, and no browser was driven. |","+| FR-2 | `/login` | FAIL | Renders correctly: Card, fields, eye toggle, Sign in button, \"Forgot your password?\" link. It does not hydrate in Run A. In Run B the toggle and sign-in work. |","+| FR-4 | `/login` error Alert | FAIL | Run A shows no Alert. Run B shows \"Email or password is incorrect.\" Locked and disabled messages were not exercised. |","+| FR-7 | callbackUrl redirect | FAIL | Users can't sign in in Run A. In Run B, an external callbackUrl goes to `/dashboard` and `/account/security` is honoured. |","+| FR-11 | middleware redirect | **PASS** | `/dashboard` → `/login?callbackUrl=%2Fdashboard` with CSP enforced. This is server-side. |","+| FR-13 | `/invite/[token]` | FAIL | The invalid and valid states render correctly: exact invalid-link copy, read-only name and email, checklist, Activate account. Accepting is impossible in Run A, and a submit would leak the password (UIV-2). Accepting was not exercised in Run B, to avoid activating the seeded invite user. |","+| FR-16 | PasswordChecklist | FAIL | Present on the invite, reset and security pages with all 4 rules. It is static in Run A. In Run B it updates live: for \"abc1\", letter, number and not-email are met and length is unmet. |","+| FR-17 | `/forgot-password` | FAIL | Renders correctly. In Run B, an unknown email shows the message that doesn't reveal whether the account exists. In Run A, submit does nothing. |","+| FR-19 | `/reset-password/[token]` | FAIL | The invalid state shows the copy plus a \"Request a new reset link\" link. Run A: the password leaked into the URL and the log, and no reset happened. Run B: redirect to `/login?reset=1` and the toast \"Password updated. Sign in with your new password.\" Minor: a dev-only hydration warning appears on this page. |","+| FR-20 | `/account/security` | FAIL | Not reachable through the UI in Run A. In Run B the fields, toggles and checklist render, and a wrong current password shows \"Current password is incorrect.\" The successful change was not exercised. |","+| FR-21 | Menu \"Account security\" | FAIL | The menu can't open in Run A. In Run B the item is present with a lock icon and links correctly. |","+| FR-25 | Shell uses the session user | **PASS** | Server-rendered initials \"AA\" for Alice Admin. PLACEHOLDER_USER is gone. |","+| FR-26 | User menu name/badge/sign out | FAIL | The avatar renders, but the menu can't open in Run A. In Run B it shows \"Alice Admin\", an ADMIN chip and Sign out, and Sign out goes to `/login` with the session cleared. |","+| FR-27 | Role-filtered sidebar | **PASS** | ADMIN sees Dashboard, Notifications, Email log, Sections, Courses. STUDENT sees Dashboard, Notifications, My courses. |"," ","-## Pre-existing issues seen while rendering (not SH-6 scope)","+## Side effects to know about"," ","-- **MUI X version mismatch.** `@mui/x-internals` 9.15.0 is installed against `@mui/x-data-grid` 9.5.0. As a result:","-  - `/admin/sections` returns 500.","-  - After that, the dev server returns 500 on every request until it is restarted. This includes the timetable APIs, which can make them look broken when they are not.","-- **No login page.** `/login` returns 404, and `src/app/(auth)/` contains only `layout.tsx`. Users can only sign in through the API.","-","-## Recommendation","-","-Send SH-6 back to Dev for TASK-9 to TASK-16, then run this phase again. Once the seed (FR-41 to FR-44) exists, the re-run should drive a real browser:","-- Run `npx playwright install chromium`.","-- Render the editor drag, clash and toast flow, the student Today view, the parent child switch, and print preview.","+- Creating a test INVITE token for `invited@schoolhub.test` invalidated the invite link the seed logged earlier. Re-run `npm run db:seed` to get a fresh link."]}],"originalFile":"# UI Verification Report: SH-6 (PRD-06 Bell Schedule & Timetable)\n\n- **ticketId:** SH-6\n- **timestamp:** 2026-11-05T05:36:59Z\n- **status:** complete (the verification ran, and the UI is absent)\n- **Result:** 0 PASS, 19 FAIL, 1 BLOCKED, out of 20 UI-facing requirements\n- **Design reference:** none (there is no `figma-readiness.json`). The checks compare against the PRD text in `requirements.json`.\n\n## Headline\n\n**None of the SH-6 UI exists.** Every timetable page was rendered as a signed-in ADMIN, and each one returned **HTTP 404**. The checks were:\n- `/timetable`\n- `/admin/timetable`\n- `/admin/timetable/periods`\n\nThis confirms the QA finding: Dev stopped after TASK-8, the backend. TASK-9 to TASK-14 (grid, bell schedule, editor, personal, student and course views, navigation) were never built.\n\nThe backend that the UI would use does respond:\n- `GET /api/periods` returns 200 `{data:[]}`. It is empty because the seed (TASK-15) was not built either.\n- `GET /api/school-days` returns 200, with Mon–Fri teaching and a `slotCount` for each day.\n\n## How it was checked\n\n1. Started the project's own dev server (`npx next dev -p 3200`) against the local Postgres on :5433.\n2. Created a temporary ADMIN `uiv-sh6@test.local` and signed in through the next-auth credentials callback.\n3. Requested each route. The temporary user and its audit rows were deleted afterwards, and the dev server was stopped.\n4. Pages that cannot be reached without seed data (the student and course tabs) were checked against the route files and the tab registries in the source instead. These are marked FAIL, not PASS, because the code is provably missing.\n\n## Findings\n\n| Req | Surface | Verdict | Notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| FR-5 | Bell schedule `/admin/timetable/periods` | FAIL | 404. `page.tsx` and `BellScheduleEditor.tsx` are missing. |\n| FR-7 | Teaching-day ToggleButtons + confirm | FAIL | 404. Only the API exists (it returns slotCount per day). |\n| FR-15 | Timetable editor `/admin/timetable` | FAIL | 404. `TimetableEditor.tsx` is missing. |\n| FR-16 | TimetableGrid | FAIL | `src/components/TimetableGrid/` does not exist. |\n| FR-17 | Sidebar \"placed N\" + drop to place | FAIL | The host page returns 404, and the code is missing. |\n| FR-18 | Drag move / remove + confirm | FAIL | The host page returns 404. `@dnd-kit/core` is never imported. |\n| FR-19 | Clash tint + icon + tooltip | FAIL | The host page returns 404. The availability API exists. |\n| FR-20 | Snap-back + clash toast | FAIL | The host page returns 404, and the code is missing. |\n| FR-21 | Room Popover (free rooms) | FAIL | The host page returns 404. The free-rooms API exists. |\n| FR-22 | Keyboard \"Place course\" dialog | FAIL | The host page returns 404, and the code is missing. |\n| FR-23 | dnd-kit + MUI Paper/Card/Chip | FAIL | No components to inspect. |\n| FR-24 | Personal `/timetable` | FAIL | 404. `PersonalTimetable.tsx` is missing. |\n| FR-25 | Parent child selector | FAIL | `/timetable` returns 404. |\n| FR-26 | Week/Today + Now/Next badges | FAIL | `/timetable` returns 404. The `nowAndNext` helper exists but no UI uses it. |\n| FR-27 | Student \"Timetable\" tab | FAIL | `student-tabs.ts` has only `courses`, and the route directory does not exist. |\n| FR-28 | Course \"Schedule\" tab | FAIL | `course-tabs.ts` has only `overview` and `roster`, and there is no `schedule/` route. |\n| FR-29 | Print button + A4 print layout | FAIL | There is no grid to print, and the print components are missing. |\n| FR-32 | Nav entries (Timetable / editor / Bell schedule) | FAIL | Not in `navigation.ts` or the rendered dashboard HTML. |\n| NFR-4 | Accessibility signals | FAIL | Depends on FR-19, FR-22 and FR-26, which are all missing. |\n| NFR-16 | Cross-browser + print output | BLOCKED | There is no UI to check, and no browser was driven. |\n\n## Pre-existing issues seen while rendering (not SH-6 scope)\n\n- **MUI X version mismatch.** `@mui/x-internals` 9.15.0 is installed against `@mui/x-data-grid` 9.5.0. As a result:\n  - `/admin/sections` returns 500.\n  - After that, the dev server returns 500 on every request until it is restarted. This includes the timetable APIs, which can make them look broken when they are not.\n- **No login page.** `/login` returns 404, and `src/app/(auth)/` contains only `layout.tsx`. Users can only sign in through the API.\n\n## Recommendation\n\nSend SH-6 back to Dev for TASK-9 to TASK-16, then run this phase again. Once the seed (FR-41 to FR-44) exists, the re-run should drive a real browser:\n- Run `npx playwright install chromium`.\n- Render the editor drag, clash and toast flow, the student Today view, the parent child switch, and print preview.\n","userModified":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_019hMxuHeqPeis77YidJNhUS","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
