{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_013KDQgkeUo3nYCoTKVUv9eE","type":"tool_result","content":"model SectionMember {\n  id             String   @id @default(cuid())\n  sectionId      String\n  section        Section  @relation(fields: [sectionId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)\n  studentId      String\n  student        User     @relation(fields: [studentId], references: [id])\n  joinedAt       DateTime @default(now())\n  academicYearId String\n\n  @@unique([studentId, academicYearId])\n}\nsectionMember \"\\nInvalid `prisma.sectionMember.createMany()` invocation in\\n/private/tmp/sh7-uiv-scripts/run.cjs:75:32\\n\\n  72 const maxOrder = (await prisma.period.aggregate({ _max: { order: true } }))._max.order ?? 0;\"\ncsp-enforced {\"hydrated\":false,\"cspErrors\":10}\nteacher-landing-360 {\"url\":\"/attendance/take\",\"status\":200,\"consoleErrors\":[],\"text\":\"SchoolHub 0 TT Take attendance Friday 6 November 2026 Register date 11/ 06/ 2026 Register date Daily register – uiv-att Not taken TAKE ATTENDANCE UIV Attendance – uiv-att uiv-att · 00:00–23:59 · Now Not taken TAKE ATTENDANCE\"}\nlanding-entries {\"course\":1,\"daily\":1,\"notTaken\":2}\nteacher-register-empty-360 {\"url\":\"/attendance/take/cmw4lffbr000cxddcznnxrgcm?date=2026-11-06&periodId=cmw4lffbj0007xddcigkk2wk3\",\"status\":200,\"consoleErrors\":[],\"text\":\"SchoolHub 0 TT Take attendance / Register UIV Attendance uiv-att · uiv-att · Friday 6 Nov 2026 Present 0 Absent 0 Late 0 Unmarked 3 MARK ALL PRESENT AA Alex Absent P A L E LL Lee Late P A L E PP Pat Present P A L E 3 students not marked SAVE\"}\nsave-disabled-initially true\nmark-all-keeps-existing {\"present2\":true,\"absent1\":true}\nminutes-default \"5\"\nexcused-disabled-teacher true\nFR-5 {\"description\": \"Admins can edit attendanceMode (and attendanceAlertThreshold) on the school settings page. No such page or API route exists today, so the Architect must choose the smallest admin UI and API that satisfies this.\", \"confidence\": \"MEDIUM\", \"source\": \"PRD FR-2.1 ('Admin edits it on the school settings page'), FR-8.3\"}\n\nFR-8 {\"description\": \"A date picker lets teachers open a register for any date in the past 14 days for their own courses, and admins for any date. Future dates are refused on both client and server.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"PRD FR-3.2\"}\n\nFR-9 {\"description\": \"The register page /attendance/take/[courseId]?date=&periodId= lists ACTIVE enrolled students sorted by last name, with an avatar, the name and an exclusive MUI ToggleButtonGroup (P/A/L/E). Buttons are coloured via the theme palette and have screen-reader labels. Nothing is selected by default for a new register.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"PRD FR-3.3\"}\n\nFR-12 {\"description\": \"Selecting L reveals a minutes-late input (default 5, valid range 1\\u2013240, required when LATE). Each row has an optional note (max 500 characters) behind a note icon.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"PRD FR-3.5, FR-1 field comments\"}\n\nFR-15 {\"description\": \"A daily homeroom register (sectionId + date, no period) can be read and saved by the section's homeroom teacher and by admins. Its roster is the section members.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"PRD API table (register ?sectionId=), FR-3.1, NFR-3\"}\n\nFR-16 {\"description\": \"The daily register page route and UI. The PRD names only the course register route, so the daily register is assumed to reuse the same register component at a section-scoped route (e.g. /attendance/take/section/[sectionId]?date=).\", \"confidence\": \"LOW\", \"source\": \"PRD FR-3.1 ('Daily register \\u2013 7A'), API table \\u2014 route not specified\"}\n\nFR-17 {\"description\": \"Mobile layout: works one-handed at 360 px width, rows at least 48 px tall, toggle buttons at least 44\\u00d744 px, and a sticky save bar (MUI Paper, position: sticky) at the bottom.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"PRD FR-3.8\"}\n\nFR-19 {\"description\": \"Edit window: teachers can edit their own course records until 14 days after the register date. After that only admins can edit, and others see the register read-only with an explanation. This is enforced server-side.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"PRD FR-4.2, AC-4\"}\n\nFR-25 {\"description\": \"The student Attendance tab shows summary cards for the current term and the year (attendance rate %, absent count, late count, excused count).\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"PRD FR-6.1, AC-6\"}\n\nFR-26 {\"description\": \"The tab shows a read-only month calendar built with MUI X DateCalendar and a custom 'day' slot coloured success (all present), warning (any late), error (any absent) or default (no data), with a Tooltip summary and month navigation.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"PRD FR-6.1\"}\n\nFR-27 {\"description\": \"The tab has a filterable table of records (date, period, course, status, minutes late, note). Notes are visible only to ADMIN and TEACHER and are stripped from the API response for STUDENT and PARENT.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"PRD FR-6.1, API table, AC-8\"}\n\nFR-29 {\"description\": \"Register an 'Attendance' tab in src/config/course-tabs.ts (TEACHER and ADMIN) showing a DataGrid matrix: students as rows, the last 20 session dates as horizontally scrollable columns, coloured P/A/L/E cells and a per-student rate column. Clicking a column header opens that register.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"PRD FR-7.1\"}\n\nFR-30 {\"description\": \"/admin/attendance Today overview shows sessions expected vs taken today and the school-wide rate today.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"PRD FR-8.1\"}\n\nFR-31 {\"description\": \"It lists 'Missing registers' (meetings with no register 15 minutes after period start, in the school timezone), each with a 'Remind teacher' button that POSTs to /api/admin/attendance/remind and sends 'attendance.register_missing' to the teacher.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"PRD FR-8.1, API table\"}\n\nFR-32 {\"description\": \"The report builder filters by date range (max 366 days), grade level, section, course and status, and shows a per-student summary (records, present, absent, late, excused, rate). CSV export with the same columns comes from ?format=csv.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"PRD FR-8.2, Goal 3\"}\n\nFR-33 {\"description\": \"The 'Below threshold' view lists students whose year-to-date rate is below SchoolSettings.attendanceAlertThreshold (default 90), sorted ascending, each linked to the student page.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"PRD FR-8.3, AC-7\"}\n\n0\n64708\n64709","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b0d33c40-44ea-44a6-8793-0fcbf67c071f","uuid":"1a3ca14d-d7f9-4e99-b1a9-c7f833396cd8","timestamp":"2026-11-06T06:38:34.357Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"model SectionMember {\n  id             String   @id @default(cuid())\n  sectionId      String\n  section        Section  @relation(fields: [sectionId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)\n  studentId      String\n  student        User     @relation(fields: [studentId], references: [id])\n  joinedAt       DateTime @default(now())\n  academicYearId String\n\n  @@unique([studentId, academicYearId])\n}\nsectionMember \"\\nInvalid `prisma.sectionMember.createMany()` invocation in\\n/private/tmp/sh7-uiv-scripts/run.cjs:75:32\\n\\n  72 const maxOrder = (await prisma.period.aggregate({ _max: { order: true } }))._max.order ?? 0;\"\ncsp-enforced {\"hydrated\":false,\"cspErrors\":10}\nteacher-landing-360 {\"url\":\"/attendance/take\",\"status\":200,\"consoleErrors\":[],\"text\":\"SchoolHub 0 TT Take attendance Friday 6 November 2026 Register date 11/ 06/ 2026 Register date Daily register – uiv-att Not taken TAKE ATTENDANCE UIV Attendance – uiv-att uiv-att · 00:00–23:59 · Now Not taken TAKE ATTENDANCE\"}\nlanding-entries {\"course\":1,\"daily\":1,\"notTaken\":2}\nteacher-register-e