bile.\n3. **FR-14 (minor): one save shows two different times.**\n   - \"Last changed by … at 11:39:36 AM\" uses the browser's timezone (`toLocaleString`).\n   - The landing page (\"Taken 01:39\") and the notification (\"1:39 AM\") use the school timezone.\n\n## Findings\n\n| FR | Surface | Verdict | Notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| FR-5 | /admin/attendance Settings tab | **FAIL** | The page doesn't compile (UIV-1). `admin-attendance-1280.png` |\n| FR-6 | /attendance/take landing | **FAIL** | Content is correct (meeting, time, Now, Not taken, then \"Taken 01:39 by Terry Teach\" and REVIEW after the save). The page overflows to 407 px at 360 px. `teacher-landing-360.png` |\n| FR-7 | Daily register entry | PASS | \"Daily register – uiv-att · Not taken · TAKE ATTENDANCE\" shows with mode BOTH |\n| FR-8 | Date picker and limits | PASS | Future date is refused with an alert. Teacher at 20 days is refused. Admin opens a 20-day-old date. The picker's 360 px overflow is under FR-6 |\n| FR-9 | Register list | PASS | Sorted by last name. Avatars, P/A/L/E toggles with aria-labels, nothing preselected, theme colours when selected |\n| FR-10 | EXCUSED | PASS | E is disabled for the teacher and enabled for the admin |\n| FR-11 | Mark all present | PASS | It kept Lee's existing Absent, giving Present 2 · Absent 1 |\n| FR-12 | Minutes late and note | PASS | L reveals \"Minutes late\" prefilled with 5. The note icon opens a note field, and the note is still there after saving. The range and length limits were not tested in the UI |\n| FR-13 | Counters and Save state | PASS | Counters update live. Save is disabled at \"3 students not marked\" and enabled at \"Everyone is marked\" |\n| FR-14 | Save and last changed | PASS | \"Attendance saved\" toast and \"Last changed by Terry Teach…\" both show. Minor timezone mismatch (defect 3) |\n| FR-15 | Daily register roster | PASS | All 3 section members are listed |\n| FR-16 | Section register route | PASS | Same component, with the \"Daily register\" breadcrumb and title. Saving was not tested in the UI |\n| FR-17 | Register at 360 px | PASS | No overflow. Rows are 110–158 px tall, toggles are at least 44×49 px, and the save bar is sticky at the bottom |\n| FR-19 | Register past 14 days (teacher) | **FAIL** | An alert only, no read-only register (defect 1). `teacher-register-old-360.png` |\n| FR-21 | Parent absence notification | PASS | \"Alex Absent was marked absent\" shows with an unread badge of 1, at 375 px |\n| FR-24 | Student Attendance tab | **FAIL** | 500 with the compile overlay (UIV-1). `parent-student-attendance-375.png` |\n| FR-25 | Summary cards | BLOCKED | UIV-1 |\n| FR-26 | Month calendar (red day and tooltip) | BLOCKED | UIV-1, so the parent red-day check can't be confirmed |\n| FR-27 | Records table and note visibility | BLOCKED | UIV-1 |\n| FR-29 | Course matrix | **FAIL** | 500 with an import trace through CourseAttendanceMatrix.tsx (run 1, server log) |\n| FR-30 | Admin Today overview | BLOCKED | UIV-1 |\n| FR-31 | Missing registers and Remind | BLOCKED | UIV-1 |\n| FR-32 | Report builder and CSV | BLOCKED | UIV-1 |\n| FR-33 | Below threshold | BLOCKED | UIV-1 |\n| FR-34 | Navigation | PASS | Teacher: Attendance links to /attendance/take. Admin: Attendance links to /admin/attendance in the main group |\n\n## Not covered\n\n- **FR-22** (the corrected notification) has no separate UI surface and was not driven. QA already reported a service-level defect for it.\n- **FR-20 and FR-23** are type registrations with no UI of their own.\n\n## Recommended next steps\n\n1. **Fix UIV-1** (a dependency pin), then re-run this phase so the student tab, course matrix and admin page can be checked visually.\n2. **Fix FR-19:** let teachers *open* out-of-window registers in read-only mode. That means relaxing `canOpen` for reads and keeping `canEdit` for writes.\n3. **Fix the 360 px overflow** on the landing page's PageHeader and DatePicker.\n"}}}
