exercised: the time-limit-longer-than-window validation in the Settings panel, saving accommodations, Regrade, Release results, drag reorder and image upload (QA covers them through unit, integration and e2e tests).\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"method\": \"Production build (`npm run build`, exit 0) served with `next start -p 3300` against local Postgres :5433. The existing :3000 and :3001 servers were left alone. A throwaway Playwright driver outside the repo (/tmp/uiv-sh10/driver.cjs) created tagged fixtures (code 'uiv-sh10'): a teacher, 3 students, a parent linked to 1 studen","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"95715b00-b89d-488d-810b-cf963fb0733f","uuid":"6b9da2dd-1d54-4148-b7d2-c89ba07f881e","timestamp":"2026-11-09T14:39:44.340Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"Ticket SH-11: execute the ui-verification phase (task ui-verification-main). Read prior phase artifacts under artifacts/, follow ui-verification.md, and write this phase's artifacts to artifacts/ui-verification/.----\nartifacts/ui-verification:\ntotal 104\ndrwxr-xr-x   6 ikramaansari  staff    192 Nov  9 13:06 .\ndrwxr-xr-x  12 ikramaansari  staff    384 Nov  9 16:57 ..\ndrwxr-xr-x  34 ikramaansari  staff   1088 Nov  9 13:21 screenshots\n-rw-r--r--   1 ikramaansari  staff  14890 Nov  9 13:24 ui-verification-report.json\n-rw-r--r--   1 ikramaansari  staff  15938 Nov  9 13:31 ui-verification-report.md\n-rw-r--r--   1 ikramaansari  staff  20050 Nov  9 13:09 uiv-raw.json\n\nartifacts/ui-verification/screenshots:\ntotal 6704\ndrwxr-xr-x  34 ikramaansari  staff    1088 Nov  9 13:21 .\ndrwxr-xr-x   6 ikramaansari  staff     192 Nov  9 13:06 ..\n-rw-r--r--   1 ikramaansari  staff   32055 Nov  9 13:08 parent-course-quizzes-375.png\n-rw-r--r--   1 ikramaansari  staff   43012 Nov  9 13:09 parent-result-375.png\n-rw-r--r--   1 ikramaansari  staff   75636 Nov  9 13:07 student-course-quizzes-375.png\n-rw-r--r--   1 ikramaansari  staff   79740 Nov  9 13:07 student-course-quizzes-after-375.png\n-rw-r--r--   