ev database:** the current academic year (2026-2027) has none, so these features can't be used there until an admin adds terms. The gradebook shows a clear message instead of crashing. I used a temporary term for testing.\n- **Leftover data from QA's tests:** 9 term-grade override rows point to courses that no longer exist. They were created before this phase, and several have the comment text from `tests/e2e/report-cards.spec.ts`, whose cleanup doesn't delete overrides. The table has no foreign key to Course, so deleting a course doesn't remove them. I left them alone.\n\nI removed all my test data afterwards (checked: none left) and stopped the server. These reports replace the old SH-10 ones in `artifacts/ui-verification/`.\n\nFiles are in `artifacts/ui-verification/`:\n- ui-verification-report.json\n- ui-verification-report.md\n- uiv-raw.json\n- screenshots/","ttft_ms":30018,"type":"result","duration_ms":1398903,"uuid":"962c881c-0548-4824-98b4-2bf884d6e8ee","ttft_stream_ms":29023,"time_to_request_ms":150,"first_content_frame_ms":29024,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0,"model_usage_since_last_result":{"claude-opus-5-5":{"inputTokens":128,"outputTokens":55878,"cacheReadInputTokens":6811128,"cacheCreationInputTokens":875240,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":6.9043086,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":128000,"thinkingTokens":11277,"cacheCreationEphemeral5mInputTokens":859303,"cacheCreationEphemeral1hInputTokens":15937,"canonicalModel":"claude-opus-5-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}}}
