{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_0195U13f3CfHFs5oAsMYgV9s","type":"tool_result","content":"PRD-14: School Calendar, Events & Holidays --brownfield --tech-stack react\n{\"id\": \"FR-1\", \"description\": \"Install @mui/x-scheduler pinned to the exact version found via the MUI MCP server before any other work in this PRD.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"PRD \\u00a7Functional Requirements \\u203a FR-0 Dependency (1)\"}\n\n{\"id\": \"FR-2\", \"description\": \"Add Prisma enums EventCategory, Recurrence, RsvpResponse and models CalendarEvent, EventAudience, EventRsvp (composite PK eventId+userId) and CalendarFeedToken exactly as specified, with cascade deletes and the [startAt, endAt] index, in one new migration.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"PRD \\u00a7FR-1 Data model\"}\n\n{\"id\": \"FR-3\", \"description\": \"EventAudience.type reuses the AudienceType enum from PRD-12; because that enum does not exist in the workspace, its values (at least SCHOOL, COURSE, SECTION, grade-level style targets implied by seed data) must be defined by this ticket or supplied by PRD-12.\", \"confidence\": \"LOW\", \"source\": \"PRD \\u00a7FR-1 (EventAudience.type comment 'reuse enum from PRD-12'); \\u00a7Seed Data (Grade 6\\u20138, Grade 7 parents, course audience); brownfield finding\"}\n\n{\"id\": \"FR-4\", \"description\": \"Validate events with Zod in src/lib/validators/calendar.ts: title \\u2264 150 chars, description Markdown \\u2264 5,000 chars, endAt \\u2265 startAt, all-day events stored as school-timezone midnight with exclusive endAt, recurrenceUntil required for WEEKLY/MONTHLY and \\u2264 1 year after start, RSVP guests 0\\u20135.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"PRD \\u00a7FR-1 field comments; \\u00a7FR-4 Recurrence; \\u00a7Platform Context \\u203a Validation\"}\n\n{\"id\": \"FR-5\", \"description\": \"isNoSchool defaults to true for HOLIDAY and TERM_BREAK categories and false otherwise.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"PRD \\u00a7FR-1 (isNoSchool comment)\"}\n\n{\"id\": \"FR-6\", \"description\": \"ADMIN may create events with any audience; isNoSchool, isPublic and the HOLIDAY/TERM_BREAK categories are admin-only.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"PRD \\u00a7FR-2 Permissions (1)\"}\n\n{\"id\": \"FR-7\", \"description\": \"TEACHER may create events only for COURSE audiences they manage or their homeroom SECTION, using the same rule as PRD-12's audience.ts (a SCHOOL-audience create by a teacher returns 403).\", \"confidence\": \"MEDIUM\", \"source\": \"PRD \\u00a7FR-2 Permissions (2); Acceptance Criterion 7\"}\n\n{\"id\": \"FR-8\", \"description\": \"Creators may edit/delete their own events; admins may edit/delete all events.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"PRD \\u00a7FR-2 Permissions (3)\"}\n\n{\"id\": \"FR-9\", \"description\": \"Add /calendar page using MUI X Scheduler EventCalendar with month (default \\u2265 768 px), week (07:00\\u201319:00 time grid, all-day row; viewConfig startTime 7, endTime 19) and agenda (default < 768 px; grouped by day, 30 days ahead, infinite scroll) views plus Today/previous/next/date-picker navigation; fall back to @mui/material + @mui/x-date-pickers (DateCalendar + List) only for behaviour missing from the Community version.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"PRD \\u00a7FR-3 Calendar page (1)\"}\n\n{\"id\": \"FR-10\", \"description\": \"Calendar sources are toggleable MUI Chips persisted in localStorage: School events (coloured by category), My assignments (due dates, subject colour), My quizzes (availability window end), My timetable (Week view only, light background blocks), Holidays.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"PRD \\u00a7FR-3 (2)\"}\n\n{\"id\": \"FR-11\", \"description\": \"Parents get a child filter (All children or one); deadline items for the selected children are labelled with the child's name.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"PRD \\u00a7FR-3 (3); Acceptance Criterion 3\"}\n\n{\"id\": \"FR-12\", \"description\": \"Clicking an event opens a right-anchored MUI Drawer showing title, category badge, time in school timezone, location, description (Markdown), audience chips, RSVP controls when enabled, 'Add to my calendar' (.ics download of that event) and edit/delete for permitted users.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"PRD \\u00a7FR-3 (4)\"}\n\n{\"id\": \"FR-13\", \"description\": \"Clicking an assignment or quiz deadline navigates to that assignment or quiz.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"PRD \\u00a7FR-3 (4); Acceptance Criterion 3\"}\n\n{\"id\": \"FR-14\", \"description\": \"ADMIN/TEACHER see a 'New event' button opening an editor Dialog with all model fields, the PRD-12 audience builder, recurrence options, RSVP toggle and RSVP deadline.\", \"confidence\": \"MEDIUM\", \"source\": \"PRD \\u00a7FR-3 (5) (audience builder does not exist in workspace \\u2014 see FR-3)\"}\n\n{\"id\": \"FR-15\", \"description\": \"Recurring events (NONE/WEEKLY/MONTHLY-by-date) are stored once and expanded at read time by expandOccurrences(event, from, to) up to recurrenceUntil; the calendar API returns plain expanded occurrences; edits apply to the whole series.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"PRD \\u00a7FR-4 Recurrence; \\u00a7FR-3 (1); \\u00a7Out of Scope; Acceptance Criterion 4\"}\n\n{\"id\": \"FR-16\", \"description\": \"isSchoolDay(date) in src/server/calendar/calendar-service.ts returns false when the weekday is not a PRD-06 teaching day or any isNoSchool event with SCHOOL audience covers the date, and exposes the reason (e.g. holiday title).\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"PRD \\u00a7FR-5 Holidays integration (1); Acceptance Criterion 1\"}\n\n{\"id\": \"FR-17\", \"description\": \"Update PRD-06 getScheduleForDate to return an empty list with reason 'Holiday: <title>' on non-school days; Today views show the holiday name instead of classes.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"PRD \\u00a7FR-5 (2); Acceptance Criterion 1\"}\n\n{\"id\": \"FR-18\", \"description\": \"Update PRD-07 teacher register landing to show 'No classes today \\u2014 <holiday>' on non-school days; opening a register for such a date shows a warning banner and saving requires an extra 'Record attendance on a holiday anyway' confirmation.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"PRD \\u00a7FR-5 (3); Acceptance Criterion 2\"}\n\n{\"id\": \"FR-19\", \"description\": \"PRD-09 assignment editor and PRD-10 quiz settings show a non-blocking warning 'This date is a holiday (<title>).' when the due/close date is a non-school day, still allowing save.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"PRD \\u00a7FR-5 (4); Acceptance Criterion 8\"}\n\n{\"id\": \"FR-20\", \"description\": \"Admin 'Add term breaks' shortcut on /admin/academic-years/[id] creates TERM_BREAK no-school events for the gaps between consecutive terms.\", \"confidence\": \"MEDIUM\", \"source\": \"PRD \\u00a7FR-5 (5) (host page does not exist in workspace \\u2014 only the API)\"}\n\n{\"id\": \"FR-21\", \"description\": \"When RSVP is enabled, audience members answer Yes/No/Maybe with guest count (parents) and optional note via PUT /api/events/:id/rsvp until rsvpDeadline; after the deadline the API rejects and the drawer controls are disabled.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"PRD \\u00a7FR-6 RSVP (1); \\u00a7API; Acceptance Criterion 6\"}\n\n{\"id\": \"FR-22\", \"description\": \"The event drawer shows the user's own response and totals; the creator and admins see the full RSVP list with CSV export (GET /api/events/:id/rsvps?format=csv).\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"PRD \\u00a7FR-6 (1); \\u00a7API\"}\n\n{\"id\": \"FR-23\", \"description\": \"Register notification type event.rsvp_reminder; the maintenance run notifies non-responding audience members 48 hours before the RSVP deadline, once per event.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"PRD \\u00a7FR-6 (2)\"}\n\n{\"id\": \"FR-24\", \"description\": \"Add /account/calendar page with a 'Subscribe' section: private URL APP_URL/api/calendar/feed/<token>.ics, copy button, Google/Apple/Outlook instructions and 'Reset link' which invalidates the old token (old URL returns 404).\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"PRD \\u00a7FR-7 iCal feed (1); Acceptance Criterion 5\"}\n\n{\"id\": \"FR-25\", \"description\": \"Feed tokens: GET /api/me/calendar-feed and POST /api/me/calendar-feed/reset return the URL; the raw token is shown only at creation/reset and stored hashed in CalendarFeedToken.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"PRD \\u00a7API (me/calendar-feed rows); \\u00a7NFR 3\"}\n\n{\"id\": \"FR-26\", \"description\": \"The RFC 5545 text/calendar feed contains the user's school events (parents: all children's audiences) from 30 days past to 365 days ahead, assignment due dates and quiz close times with URL back to SchoolHub, RRULE for recurring events, a VTIMEZONE for the school timezone, and RFC escaping of commas, semicolons and newlines.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"PRD \\u00a7FR-7 (2); Acceptance Criteria 4, 5\"}\n\n{\"id\": \"FR-27\", \"description\": \"GET /api/calendar/feed/:token.ics is public (token-authenticated), rate limited to 60 requests per token per hour (429) and sends Cache-Control: private, max-age=900.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"PRD \\u00a7FR-7 (3); \\u00a7API\"}\n\n{\"id\": \"FR-28\", \"description\": \"Register event.created, notifying audience members when an event starting within the next 30 days is created (email default false; HOLIDAY/TERM_BREAK email default true).\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"PRD \\u00a7FR-8 Notifications (1)\"}\n\n{\"id\": \"FR-29\", \"description\": \"Register event.updated, notifying audience members once per edit when time or location of an upcoming event changes.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"PRD \\u00a7FR-8 (2)\"}\n\n{\"id\": \"FR-30\", \"description\": \"Expose getPublicEvents(from, to) and GET /api/public/events?from=&to= returning isPublic events for PRD-18.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"PRD \\u00a7FR-9 (1); \\u00a7API\"}\n\n{\"id\": \"FR-31\", \"description\": \"Expose getUpcomingEventsForUser(user, limit) for PRD-16 dashboards.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"PRD \\u00a7FR-9 (2)\"}\n\n{\"id\": \"FR-32\", \"description\": \"GET /api/calendar?from=&to=&sources=&studentId= returns merged, expanded, audience-filtered items for any role; the requested range is limited to \\u2264 100 days.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"PRD \\u00a7API (first row)\"}\n\n{\"id\": \"FR-33\", \"description\": \"Event CRUD API: POST /api/events (ADMIN, TEACHER with audience check); GET/PATCH/DELETE /api/events/:id (audience/creator/ADMIN); GET /api/events/:id/ics (audience, single-event download).\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"PRD \\u00a7API\"}\n\n{\"id\": \"FR-34\", \"description\": \"GET /api/school-day?date= (any user) returns { isSchoolDay, reason }.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"PRD \\u00a7API (last row)\"}\n\n{\"id\": \"FR-35\", \"description\": \"Add /calendar (all roles) and /account/calendar entries to src/config/navigation.ts as needed.\", \"confidence\": \"MEDIUM\", \"source\": \"PRD \\u00a7Platform Context \\u203a Code layout ('A PRD that adds a page adds its nav entry there'); \\u00a7FR-3; \\u00a7FR-7\"}\n\n{\"id\": \"FR-36\", \"description\": \"Admin edits/deletes of events created by someone else write an AuditLog row via audit().\", \"confidence\": \"MEDIUM\", \"source\": \"PRD \\u00a7Platform Context \\u203a Code layout (AuditLog rule); \\u00a7FR-2 (3)\"}\n\n{\"id\": \"FR-37\", \"description\": \"Seed 2026\\u20132027 events: Thanksgiving break (26\\u201327 Nov), Winter break (21 Dec \\u2013 1 Jan, TERM_BREAK), Semester 1 exams (11\\u201315 Jan, EXAM, Grade 6\\u20138), Parent\\u2013teacher evening (RSVP, seed date + 2 weeks, Grade 7 parents), Science fair (public), weekly Chess club (Tuesdays, Robotics Club course audience), Sports day (public, tied to the PRD-12 announcement).\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"PRD \\u00a7Seed Data\"}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a031fbe8-c9e4-4d62-8249-6f16de32552c","uuid":"99d84e4b-076d-429f-9055-bc03be846b8f","timestamp":"2026-11-10T01:55:10.457Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"PRD-14: School Calendar, Events & Holidays --brownfield --tech-stack react\n{\"id\": \"FR-1\", \"description\": \"Install @mui/x-scheduler pinned to the exact version found via the MUI MCP server before any other work in this PRD.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"PRD \\u00a7Functional Requirements \\u203a FR-0 Dependency (1)\"}\n\n{\"id\": \"FR-2\", \"description\": \"Add Prisma enums EventCategory, Recurrence, RsvpResponse and models CalendarEvent, EventAudience, EventRsvp (composite PK eventId+userId) and CalendarFeedToken exactly as specified, with cascade deletes and the [startAt, endAt] index, in one new migration.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"PRD \\u00a7FR-1 Data model\"}\n\n{\"id\": \"FR-3\", \"description\": \"EventAudience.type reuses the AudienceType enum from PRD-12; because that enum does not exist in the workspace, its values (at least SCHOOL, COURSE, SECTION, grade-level style targets implied by seed data) must be defined by this ticket or supplied by PRD-12.\", \"confidence\": \"LOW\", \"source\": \"PRD \\u00a7FR-1 (EventAudience.type comment 'reuse enum from PRD-12'); \\u00a7Seed Data (Grade 6\\u20138, Grade 7 parents, course audience); brownfield finding\"}\n\n{\"id\": \"FR-4\", \"description\": \"Validate events with Zod in src/lib/validators/calendar.ts: title \\u2264 150 chars, description Markdown \\u2264 5,000 chars, endAt \\u2265 startAt, all-day events stored as school-timezone midnight with exclusive endAt, recurrenceUntil required for WEEKLY/MONTHLY and \\u2264 1 year after start, RSVP guests 0\\u20135.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"PRD \\u00a7FR-1 field comments; \\u00a7FR-4 Recurrence; \\u00a7Platform Context \\u203a Validation\"}\n\n{\"id\": \"FR-5\", \"description\": \"isNoSchool defaults to true for HOLIDAY and TERM_BREAK categories and false otherwise.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"PRD \\u00a7FR-1 (isNoSchool comment)\"}\n\n{\"id\": \"FR-6\", \"description\": \"ADMIN may create events with any audience; isNoSchool, isPublic and the HOLIDAY/TERM_BREAK categories are admin-only.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"PRD \\u00a7FR-2 Permissions (1)\"}\n\n{\"id\": \"FR-7\", \"description\": \"TEACHER may create events only for COURSE audiences they manage or their homeroom SECTION, using the same rule as PRD-12's audience.ts (a SCHOOL-audience create by a teacher returns 403).\", \"confidence\": \"MEDIUM\", \"source\": \"PRD \\u00a7FR-2 Permissions (2); Acceptance Criterion 7\"}\n\n{\"id\": \"FR-8\", \"description\": \"Creators may edit/delete their own events; admins may edit/delete all events.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"PRD \\u00a7FR-2 Permissions (3)\"}\n\n{\"id\": \"FR-9\", \"description\": \"Add /calendar page using MUI X Scheduler EventCalendar with month (default \\u2265 768 px), week (07:00\\u201319:00 time grid, all-day row; viewConfig startTime 7, endTime 19) and agenda (default < 768 px; grouped by day, 30 days ahead, infinite scroll) views plus Today/previous/next/date-picker navigation; fall back to @mui/material + @mui/x-date-pickers (DateCalendar + List) only for behaviour missing from the Community version.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"PRD \\u00a7FR-3 Calendar page (1)\"}\n\n{\"id\": \"FR-10\", \"description\": \"Calendar sources are toggleable MUI Chips persisted in localStorage: School events (coloured by category), My assignments (due dates, subject colour), My quizzes (availability window end), My timetable (Week view only, light background blocks), Holidays.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"PRD \\u00a7FR-3 (2)\"}\n\n{\"id\": \"FR-11\", \"description\": \"Parents get a child filter (All children or one); deadline items for the selected children are labelled with the child's name.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"PRD \\u00a7FR-3 (3); Acceptance Criterion 3\"}\n\n{\"id\": \"FR-12\", \"description\": \"Clicking an event opens a right-anchored MUI Drawer showing title, category badge, time in school timezone, location, description (Markdown), audience chips, RSVP controls when enabled, 'Add to my calendar' (.ics download of that event) and edit/delete for permitted users.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"PRD \\u00a7FR-3 (4)\"}\n\n{\"id\": \"FR-13\", \"description\": \"Clicking an assignment or quiz deadline navigates to that assignment or quiz.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"PRD \\u00a7FR-3 (4); Acceptance Criterion 3\"}\n\n{\"id\": \"FR-14\", \"description\": \"ADMIN/TEACHER see a 'New event' button opening an editor Dialog with all model fields, the PRD-12 audience builder, recurrence options, RSVP toggle and RSVP deadline.\", \"confidence\": \"MEDIUM\", \"source\": \"PRD \\u00a7FR-3 (5) (audience builder does not exist in workspace \\u2014 see FR-3)\"}\n\n{\"id\": \"FR-15\", \"description\": \"Recurring events (NONE/WEEKLY/MONTHLY-by-date) are stored once and expanded at read time by expandOccurrences(event, from, to) up to recurrenceUntil; the calendar API returns plain expanded occurrences; edits apply to the whole series.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"PRD \\u00a7FR-4 Recurrence; \\u00a7FR-3 (1); \\u00a7Out of Scope; Acceptance Criterion 4\"}\n\n{\"id\": \"FR-16\", \"description\": \"isSchoolDay(date) in src/server/calendar/calendar-service.ts returns false when the weekday is not a PRD-06 teaching day or any isNoSchool event with SCHOOL audience covers the date, and exposes the reason (e.g. holiday title).\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"PRD \\u00a7FR-5 Holidays integration (1); Acceptance Criterion 1\"}\n\n{\"id\": \"FR-17\", \"description\": \"Update PRD-06 getScheduleForDate to return an empty list with reason 'Holiday: <title>' on non-school days; Today views show the holiday name instead of classes.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"PRD \\u00a7FR-5 (2); Acceptance Criterion 1\"}\n\n{\"id\": \"FR-18\", \"description\": \"Update PRD-07 teacher register landing to show 'No classes today \\u2014 <holiday>' on non-school days; opening a register for such a date shows a warning banner and saving requires an extra 'Record attendance on a holiday anyway' confirmation.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"PRD \\u00a7FR-5 (3); Acceptance Criterion 2\"}\n\n{\"id\": \"FR-19\", \"description\": \"PRD-09 assignment editor and PRD-10 quiz settings show a non-blocking warning 'This date is a holiday (<title>).' when the due/close date is a non-school day, still allowing save.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"PRD \\u00a7FR-5 (4); Acceptance Criterion 8\"}\n\n{\"id\": \"FR-20\", \"description\": \"Admin 'Add term breaks' shortcut on /admin/academic-years/[id] creates TERM_BREAK no-school events for the gaps between consecutive terms.\", \"confidence\": \"MEDIUM\", \"source\": \"PRD \\u00a7FR-5 (5) (host page does not exist in workspace \\u2014 only the API)\"}\n\n{\"id\": \"FR-21\", \"description\": \"When RSVP is enabled, audience members answer Yes/No/Maybe with guest count (parents) and optional note via PUT /api/events/:id/rsvp until rsvpDeadline; after the deadline the API rejects and the drawer controls are disabled.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"PRD \\u00a7FR-6 RSVP (1); \\u00a7API; Acceptance Criterion 6\"}\n\n{\"id\": \"FR-22\", \"description\": \"The event drawer shows the user's own response and totals; the creator and admins see the full RSVP list with CSV export (GET /api/events/:id/rsvps?format=csv).\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"PRD \\u00a7FR-6 (1); \\u00a7API\"}\n\n{\"id\": \"FR-23\", \"description\": \"Register notification type event.rsvp_reminder; the maintenance run notifies non-responding audience members 48 hours before the RSVP deadline, once per event.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"PRD \\u00a7FR-6 (2)\"}\n\n{\"id\": \"FR-24\", \"description\": \"Add /account/calendar page with a 'Subscribe' section: private URL APP_URL/api/calendar/feed/<token>.ics, copy button, Google/Apple/Outlook instructions and 'Reset link' which invalidates the old token (old URL returns 404).\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"PRD \\u00a7FR-7 iCal feed (1); Acceptance Criterion 5\"}\n\n{\"id\": \"FR-25\", \"description\": \"Feed tokens: GET /api/me/calendar-feed and POST /api/me/calendar-feed/reset return the URL; the raw token is shown only at creation/reset and stored hashed in CalendarFeedToken.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"PRD \\u00a7API (me/calendar-feed rows); \\u00a7NFR 3\"}\n\n{\"id\": \"FR-26\", \"description\": \"The RFC 5545 text/calendar feed contains the user's school events (parents: all children's audiences) from 30 days past to 365 days ahead, assignment due dates and quiz close times with URL back to SchoolHub, RRULE for recurring events, a VTIMEZONE for the school timezone, and RFC escaping of commas, semicolons and newlines.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"PRD \\u00a7FR-7 (2); Acceptance Criteria 4, 5\"}\n\n{\"id\": \"FR-27\", \"description\": \"GET /api/calendar/feed/:token.ics is public (token-authenticated), rate limited to 60 requests per token per hour (429) and sends Cache-Control: private, max-age=900.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"PRD \\u00a7FR-7 (3); \\u00a7API\"}\n\n{\"id\": \"FR-28\", \"description\": \"Register event.created, notifying audience members when an event starting within the next 30 days is created (email default false; HOLIDAY/TERM_BREAK email default true).\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"PRD \\u00a7FR-8 Notifications (1)\"}\n\n{\"id\": \"FR-29\", \"description\": \"Register event.updated, notifying audience members once per edit when time or location of an upcoming event changes.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"PRD \\u00a7FR-8 (2)\"}\n\n{\"id\": \"FR-30\", \"description\": \"Expose getPublicEvents(from, to) and GET /api/public/events?from=&to= returning isPublic events for PRD-18.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"PRD \\u00a7FR-9 (1); \\u00a7API\"}\n\n{\"id\": \"FR-31\", \"description\": \"Expose getUpcomingEventsForUser(user, limit) for PRD-16 dashboards.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"PRD \\u00a7FR-9 (2)\"}\n\n{\"id\": \"FR-32\", \"description\": \"GET /api/calendar?from=&to=&sources=&studentId= returns merged, expanded, audience-filtered items for any role; the requested range is limited to \\u2264 100 days.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"PRD \\u00a7API (first row)\"}\n\n{\"id\": \"FR-33\", \"description\": \"Event CRUD API: POST /api/events (ADMIN, TEACHER with audience check); GET/PATCH/DELETE /api/events/:id (audience/creator/ADMIN); GET /api/events/:id/ics (audience, single-event download).\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"PRD \\u00a7API\"}\n\n{\"id\": \"FR-34\", \"description\": \"GET /api/school-day?date= (any user) returns { isSchoolDay, reason }.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"PRD \\u00a7API (last row)\"}\n\n{\"id\": \"FR-35\", \"description\": \"Add /calendar (all roles) and /account/calendar entries to src/config/navigation.ts as needed.\", \"confidence\": \"MEDIUM\", \"source\": \"PRD \\u00a7Platform Context \\u203a Code layout ('A PRD that adds a page adds its nav entry there'); \\u00a7FR-3; \\u00a7FR-7\"}\n\n{\"id\": \"FR-36\", \"description\": \"Admin edits/deletes of events created by someone else write an AuditLog row via audit().\", \"confidence\": \"MEDIUM\", \"source\": \"PRD \\u00a7Platform Context \\u203a Code layout (AuditLog rule); \\u00a7FR-2 (3)\"}\n\n{\"id\": \"FR-37\", \"description\": \"Seed 2026\\u20132027 events: Thanksgiving break (26\\u201327 Nov), Winter break (21 Dec \\u2013 1 Jan, TERM_BREAK), Semester 1 exams (11\\u201315 Jan, EXAM, Grade 6\\u20138), Parent\\u2013teacher evening (RSVP, seed date + 2 weeks, Grade 7 parents), Science fair (public), weekly Chess club (Tuesdays, Robotics Club course audience), Sports day (public, tied to the PRD-12 announcement).\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"PRD \\u00a7Seed Data\"}","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_0195U13f3CfHFs5oAsMYgV9s","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
