{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgtWrZ17tdV6rQ6NxFNRD","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I couldn't verify any SH-14 UI, because none of it was built. I marked the phase **blocked**, and all 15 user-facing items are **FAIL (not implemented)**: 0 pass.\n\n**Nothing to render.** Dev finished only the backend groundwork, tasks 1–7: dependencies, database models, date and validation helpers, recurring events, the iCal builder, audience rules and notification types. None of the UI tasks has any code on disk:\n- the `/calendar` page, event drawer, new-event dialog and audience builder;\n- the `/account/calendar` subscribe page;\n- the admin \"Add term breaks\" button;\n- the calendar entries in the sidebar;\n- the holiday messages on the Today view, attendance register, assignment editor and quiz settings. Those existing screens are unchanged.\n\nThis matches QA's result (overall FAIL, 32 requirements not implemented).\n\n**Rendering was also blocked.** On the dev server for this repo (port 3001), the login page shows without styles and never becomes interactive. The form submits and comes back empty, so sign-in failed for all four seeded accounts (admin, teacher, parent, student). The server may be stale after the new scheduler dependencies were installed, but I haven't confirmed that. I didn't restart it because it's shared. The server on port 3000 runs from a different folder (`~/Documents/forge/schoolhub`) and returns 500 on every page, so I didn't use it.\n\nI made no changes to product code or the database. There's no Figma file for this ticket, so the PRD text was the only reference.\n\nBefore the next run:\n1. Re-run Dev for tasks 8–27, then QA.\n2. Restart the port 3001 dev server before running this phase again.\n\nFiles are in `artifacts/ui-verification/`:\n- `ui-verification-report.json`\n- `ui-verification-report.md` (written last)\n- `uiv-raw-sh14.log` (the login attempts)\n- `screensh