 parents.\n- **Design reference.** There is no `figma-readiness.json`, so the PRD text was the only reference.\n\n## Findings\n\n| Req | Surface | Verdict | Notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| FR-3 | Child switcher (2+ children) | PASS | A Select with avatar and first name. Switching to Sara moved to her overview and set `sh_child`. |\n| FR-4 | Invalid `sh_child` fallback | PASS | `sh_child=bogus-id` falls back to the first child with no error. |\n| FR-5 | Default child on `/assignments` and `/grades`, plus calendar filter | FAIL | `/assignments` and `/grades` follow the selected child, and `/grades` showed Sara after the switch. There is no calendar filter, because PRD-14 has no UI (ADR-11 partial). |\n| FR-6 | One-child top bar | PASS | Avatar and name only, with no dropdown. |\n| FR-7 | `/my-children` | PASS | With one child it redirects. With two it shows cards with attendance, missing work and average, at 1280 px and 390 px. |\n| FR-8 | Parent landing | PASS | `/dashboard` goes to the child overview. |\n| FR-9 | Today card | PASS | Empty state only. The child has no timetable, so the holiday and schedule variants were not seen. |\n| FR-10 | Attendance card | PASS | Shows the rate, absences, lates, \"Report an absence\" and View all. The last-5 list was not seen because there is no data. |\n| FR-11 | Assignments card | PASS | Empty state only. |\n| FR-12 | Recent grades card | PASS | Empty state only. |\n| FR-13 | Announcements card | FAIL | It is always an EmptyState with no View all link (ADR-11 partial). |\n| FR-14 | Upcoming events card | PASS | Empty state with a Conferences link. |\n| FR-15 | Teachers card | PASS | Empty state. The Message button was not seen because the child has no enrollments. |\n| FR-16 | Action items card | PASS | Empty state with a Consent forms link. |\n| FR-17 | Overview layout and links | PASS | 8 cards: 2 columns at 1280 px and 1 column at 390 px, with no clipping. 7 of the 8 have a footer link. |\n| FR-18 | Absence form fields | PASS | Date pickers default to school-today. Also present: Whole day / Specific periods, Reason, Details 0/1000, and the attach button. The e2e submitted through this form. |\n| FR-18 | Absence form period checkboxes | BLOCKED | The DB has 0 bell periods, so \"Specific periods\" shows a bare \"Periods\" label. Minor: there's no hint when no periods exist. |\n| FR-20 | Parent absence-note list | PASS | Empty state, then a row with an orange **Pending** chip and a success toast after the e2e submit. The nav entry redirects here. |\n| FR-21 | Review queue | PASS | The admin DataTable has Status, From and To filters and search. The homeroom Review → Approve flow passed in e2e. A teacher with no homeroom gets `/forbidden`, which is correct. Minor: the empty-grid overlay is clipped, and the date filters are native inputs. |\n| FR-22 | Approve / Reject | PASS | Approve was shown by the e2e. Reject was not exercised in the UI; QA unit tests cover it. |\n| FR-24 | Register badge and EXCUSED pre-fill | PASS | The \"Absence note\" chip shows, E is selected, and the summary reads Excused 1. |\n| FR-25 | Teacher EXCUSED toggle | PASS | E is enabled and pressed when an approved note covers the student. |\n| FR-28 | `/admin/conferences` and New event dialog | PASS | The row shows Grade 7, an Open chip, and Edit and Bookings. The dialog has every PRD field. |\n| FR-29 | Teacher availability | **FAIL** | The layout and controls are fine. **The slot times show in the browser timezone**: range 3–5 PM, slots 01:00–03:00. |\n| FR-30 | Parent booking page | PASS | Time buttons, the confirm dialog with a note, and \"Booked for Bea: 15:00–15:10\". The seeded event returns 404 for the local parent (child not in Grade 7), which is correct. Minor: a faint grey shape remains from the dialog's exit transition. |\n| FR-31 | Overlap error in booking UI | BLOCKED | No fixture can trigger it in the UI. The exact message text is asserted by QA integration tests. |\n| FR-32 | Cancel booking | PASS | The \"Cancel booking\" button is shown but was not clicked. |\n| FR-33 | Add to calendar (.ics) | PASS | The link is shown next to the booking. |\n| FR-34 | Teacher day view | PASS | Heading, a Print / Save as PDF button, and \"No bookings yet.\" The populated list was not seen. |\n| FR-35 | Calendar \"My meetings\" | FAIL | Not built, because there is no calendar UI (ADR-11 partial). |\n| FR-36 | `/consent-forms/new` | PASS | Markdown Write/Preview, Respond by, linked event, and audience: Course for a teacher, Grade level for an admin. |\n| FR-37 | Consent list, detail and signing | PASS | List empty state. In e2e the markdown renders, a mismatched signature shows an error toast, and a matching one shows \"Consent granted by Polly Parent\". |\n| FR-38 | Change response | PASS | The button appears after responding. |\n| FR-39 | Consent tracking | PASS | Count chips, Status filter, Export CSV, Remind (disabled when there are 0 rows), and the expected columns. Minor: the empty overlay is clipped. |\n| FR-42 | Navigation per role | PASS | Parent, homeroom teacher, plain teacher and admin each see the PRD's entries. |\n| NFR-2 | Overview paint | PASS | Informal check only: every card painted on a warm dev server. This is not a production timing. |\n| NFR-4 | MUI-only look | PASS | Consistent MUI theme throughout. The only exception is the native date inputs on the review-queue filters. |\n| NFR-8 | School-timezone display | **FAIL** | About 10 components use browser- or server-local time. The consent due date shows the wrong day. See the headline for the file list. |\n\n## Minor visual notes (not blocking)\n\n- **Empty DataGrid overlay is clipped.** On the review queue and consent tracking, an empty grid shows only the top of the inbox icon, and the \"No results\" text is hidden. This looks like the shared `DataTable`.\n- **Some avatars have no background.** `UserAvatar` sometimes renders initials with no background colour (`MM`, `PP` and `TT`).\n- **Blank Periods group.** With no bell periods, \"Specific periods\" shows an empty Periods group with no explanation.\n- **Seed creator (QA note).** The seeded \"Science Museum Trip\" is created by a teacher with a Grade-level audience, which the UI wouldn't allow that teacher to create.\n\n## Recommended next step\n\nRe-run Dev for the NFR-8 timezone fix. It is a small, mechanical change across the files listed above. Then re-check `/conferences/[id]/availability` and `/consent-forms` here.\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":1,"oldLines":84,"newStart":1,"newLines":98,"lines":["-# UI Verification Report: SH-14 (PRD-14 School Calendar, Events & Holidays)","+# UI Verification Report: SH-15 (PRD-15 Parent Portal: Child Switcher, Absence Notes & Conference Booking)"," ","-- **Ticket:** SH-14","-- **Status:** blocked","-- **Result:** 15 UI-facing findings: **0 PASS, 15 FAIL (not implemented), 0 BLOCKED**","+- **Ticket:** SH-15","+- **Status:** complete","+- **Result:** 38 findings: **31 PASS, 5 FAIL, 2 BLOCKED**"," ","-> This report replaces the SH-13 report. The SH-13 screenshots in `screenshots/` are left as they were and are also in git history. SH-14 evidence is in `screenshots-sh14/` and `uiv-raw-sh14.log`. `ui-verification-report.json` has the same findings in machine-readable form.","+> This replaces the SH-14 report. The SH-13 and SH-14 evidence folders (`screenshots/`, `screenshots-sh14/`, `uiv-raw-sh14.log`) are left as they were. SH-15 evidence is in `screenshots-sh15/` and `uiv-raw-sh15.log`. `ui-verification-report.json` has the same findings in machine-readable form."," "," ## Headline"," ","-**SH-14 has no UI to verify.** The Dev phase finished only TASK-1 to TASK-7, the backend foundation:","+Every SH-15 screen renders with MUI and the app theme, and the three PRD flows work in a real browser:"," ","-- dependencies","-- Prisma models and migration","-- validators","-- recurrence expansion","-- iCal builder","-- audience resolver","-- notification types","+- absence note → approve → register shows EXCUSED with an \"Absence note\" badge","+- parent books a conference slot with a note","+- parent signs a consent form, including the signature-mismatch error"," ","-None of the user-facing tasks has code on disk: TASK-13 and TASK-17 to TASK-23. These files are missing:","+**One defect needs a fix before release: dates and times are shown in the wrong timezone (NFR-8).** Many SH-15 components format with `toLocaleString`/`toLocaleTimeString`, which use the browser's or server's timezone instead of `SchoolSettings.timezone`. Two places show it clearly:"," ","-- `/calendar`: `page.tsx`, `CalendarView.tsx`, `SourceChips.tsx`","-- `EventDrawer.tsx`","-- `EventEditorDialog.tsx`","-- `AudienceBuilder.tsx`","-- `/account/calendar`: `page.tsx`, `SubscribeCard.tsx`","-- `/admin/academic-years/[id]`: the page and `TermBreaksButton.tsx`","+- **Teacher availability (FR-29).** The saved range reads 03:00 PM–05:00 PM, but the slots are listed as **01:00–03:00** (`AvailabilityClient.tsx:25`).","+- **Consent due date.** The seeded form is due 19 Nov 23:59 school time. It displays as **\"Due 11/20/2026, 9:59:00 AM\"**, which is the wrong day."," ","-None of the existing screens was changed for holidays either: the timetable Today view, the attendance register, the assignment editor and the quiz settings. `src/config/navigation.ts` has no calendar entries.","+The fix is mechanical: switch to the existing `formatInSchoolTz` from `src/lib/dates`, which `day/page.tsx` and the services already use. Affected lines:"," ","-This agrees with the QA report: overall FAIL, with 32 requirements NOT-IMPLEMENTED.","+- `conferences/[id]/availability/AvailabilityClient.tsx:25`","+- `conferences/[id]/page.tsx:26`","+- `consent-forms/page.tsx:18`","+- `consent-forms/[id]/page.tsx:23,36`","+- `consent-forms/[id]/ConsentResponseForm.tsx:60`","+- `consent-forms/[id]/tracking/page.tsx:18`","+- `consent-forms/[id]/tracking/ConsentTrackingClient.tsx:104,127`","+- `attendance/absence-notes/AbsenceNotesReviewClient.tsx:149,194`","+- `my-children/[studentId]/OverviewCards.tsx:35-36`"," ","-**What needs to happen:** re-run Dev for TASK-8 to TASK-27, then QA, then this phase.","+The other three FAILs are the partial items ADR-11 already accepted: FR-5 (the calendar filter part), FR-13 (Announcements) and FR-35 (My meetings in the calendar)."," ","-## The environment also blocked rendering","+## How it was rendered"," ","-Even for pages that already exist, nothing could be rendered after login:","+- **Server.** I used `next dev` on :3201 with Chromium through Playwright, at 1280 px and 390 px.","+  - The production build (`next build` and `next start` on :3200) serves pages, but **nothing hydrates**. `next.config.js` sends `script-src 'self'` with no nonce, so Next's inline bootstrap scripts are blocked. This config dates from the project-startup commit, not SH-15, and is the same issue as the known QA blocker 1.","+  - I didn't use the shared servers: :3000 returns 500 and :3001 hangs.","+- **Signed-in sweep.** As parent, teacher and admin, I signed in through the credentials callback and visited every SH-15 route, recording status, URL, headings, console errors and a full-page screenshot.","+  - For the multi-child cases, a second `ParentStudentLink` was **added temporarily and deleted afterwards**.","+- **E2E flows.** The 3 SH-15 e2e specs ran against :3201 with screenshots on. All 4 tests passed, and the end-of-flow screenshots are in `screenshots-sh15/e2e/`. These specs build their own fixtures, because the local DB has no student profiles, enrollments, bell periods or Grade 7 parents.","+- **Design reference.** There is no `figma-readiness.json`, so the PRD text was the only reference."," ","-- **:3001 server:** the `next dev` server for this repo serves `/login` without styles (serif fallback fonts, no MUI theme), and the page never hydrates. Playwright fills the form and the value reads back correctly. The native form POST then reloads the page empty, so login failed for **all four seeded roles** (admin, teacher, parent, student). The `*-error.png` screenshots show this.","-  - A likely cause is that the dev server is stale after the TASK-1 dependency and override changes to `@mui/x-scheduler` and `@mui/x-internals`. This is not confirmed.","-  - I did not restart the server because it is shared.","-  - **Restart the dev server before the next UI-verification run.**","-- **:3000 server:** this one runs from a different checkout (`~/Documents/forge/schoolhub`) and returns 500 for every route, so it was not used.","-- **Signed-out requests:** without a session, `/calendar` and `/account/calendar` return 307 to `/login`, and `/api/calendar` and `/api/school-day` return 401. That is only the auth middleware answering, not evidence that a page or route exists.","-- **Design reference:** there is no `figma-readiness.json`, so the PRD text was the only reference.","-"," ## Findings"," ","-All verdicts are **FAIL**. Each surface is missing from source, which I confirmed with a file check and `git diff`. None was marked PASS, because nothing was rendered.","-"," | Req | Surface | Verdict | Notes |"," |---|---|---|---|","-| FR-9 | `/calendar` (month, week and agenda views, navigation) | FAIL | `calendar/page.tsx` and `CalendarView.tsx` do not exist (TASK-20). |","-| NFR-12 | Default view (month at 768 px or wider, agenda below 768 px) | FAIL | Depends on the missing `/calendar` page. |","-| FR-10 | Source chips | FAIL | `SourceChips.tsx` and `sources.ts` do not exist. |","-| FR-11 | Parent child filter and child-name labels | FAIL | There is no calendar page or sources code. |","-| FR-12 | Event drawer, including the \"Add to my calendar\" .ics download | FAIL | `EventDrawer.tsx` and `/api/events/[id]/ics` do not exist. |","-| FR-13 | Clicking a deadline opens the assignment or quiz | FAIL | There is no calendar page. |","-| FR-14 | \"New event\" button, editor dialog and audience builder | FAIL | `EventEditorDialog.tsx` and `AudienceBuilder.tsx` do not exist. |","-| FR-21 | RSVP controls, disabled after the deadline | FAIL | There is no drawer and no RSVP API. |","-| FR-22 | Own RSVP and totals; full list and CSV export for the creator and admins | FAIL | There is no drawer and no `rsvps` API. |","-| FR-24 | `/account/calendar` Subscribe card | FAIL | The page, `SubscribeCard.tsx` and `/api/me/calendar-feed` do not exist. |","-| FR-35 | Calendar entries in the sidebar | FAIL | `navigation.ts` has 0 calendar entries. |","-| FR-17 | Holiday name shown in Today and timetable views | FAIL | `getScheduleForDate` is unchanged and only has a \"holidays hook in here\" comment. `isSchoolDay` does not exist. |","-| FR-18 | Holiday banner and confirmation on the attendance register | FAIL | The register page and `RegisterForm.tsx` are unchanged. |","-| FR-19 | Holiday warning in the assignment editor and quiz settings | FAIL | `AssignmentForm.tsx` and `QuizSettingsPanel.tsx` are unchanged. |","-| FR-20 | \"Add term breaks\" admin button | FAIL | The page, the button and the API do not exist. |","+| FR-3 | Child switcher (2+ children) | PASS | A Select with avatar and first name. Switching to Sara moved to her overview and set `sh_child`. |","+| FR-4 | Invalid `sh_child` fallback | PASS | `sh_child=bogus-id` falls back to the first child with no error. |","+| FR-5 | Default child on `/assignments` and `/grades`, plus calendar filter | FAIL | `/assignments` and `/grades` follow the selected child, and `/grades` showed Sara after the switch. There is no calendar filter, because PRD-14 has no UI (ADR-11 partial). |","+| FR-6 | One-child top bar | PASS | Avatar and name only, with no dropdown. |","+| FR-7 | `/my-children` | PASS | With one child it redirects. With two it shows cards with attendance, missing work and average, at 1280 px and 390 px. |","+| FR-8 | Parent landing | PASS | `/dashboard` goes to the child overview. |","+| FR-9 | Today card | PASS | Empty state only. The child has no timetable, so the holiday and schedule variants were not seen. |","+| FR-10 | Attendance card | PASS | Shows the rate, absences, lates, \"Report an absence\" and View all. The last-5 list was not seen because there is no data. |","+| FR-11 | Assignments card | PASS | Empty state only. |","+| FR-12 | Recent grades card | PASS | Empty state only. |","+| FR-13 | Announcements card | FAIL | It is always an EmptyState with no View all link (ADR-11 partial). |","+| FR-14 | Upcoming events card | PASS | Empty state with a Conferences link. |","+| FR-15 | Teachers card | PASS | Empty state. The Message button was not seen because the child has no enrollments. |","+| FR-16 | Action items card | PASS | Empty state with a Consent forms link. |","+| FR-17 | Overview layout and links | PASS | 8 cards: 2 columns at 1280 px and 1 column at 390 px, with no clipping. 7 of the 8 have a footer link. |","+| FR-18 | Absence form fields | PASS | Date pickers default to school-today. Also present: Whole day / Specific periods, Reason, Details 0/1000, and the attach button. The e2e submitted through this form. |","+| FR-18 | Absence form period checkboxes | BLOCKED | The DB has 0 bell periods, so \"Specific periods\" shows a bare \"Periods\" label. Minor: there's no hint when no periods exist. |","+| FR-20 | Parent absence-note list | PASS | Empty state, then a row with an orange **Pending** chip and a success toast after the e2e submit. The nav entry redirects here. |","+| FR-21 | Review queue | PASS | The admin DataTable has Status, From and To filters and search. The homeroom Review → Approve flow passed in e2e. A teacher with no homeroom gets `/forbidden`, which is correct. Minor: the empty-grid overlay is clipped, and the date filters are native inputs. |","+| FR-22 | Approve / Reject | PASS | Approve was shown by the e2e. Reject was not exercised in the UI; QA unit tests cover it. |","+| FR-24 | Register badge and EXCUSED pre-fill | PASS | The \"Absence note\" chip shows, E is selected, and the summary reads Excused 1. |","+| FR-25 | Teacher EXCUSED toggle | PASS | E is enabled and pressed when an approved note covers the student. |","+| FR-28 | `/admin/conferences` and New event dialog | PASS | The row shows Grade 7, an Open chip, and Edit and Bookings. The dialog has every PRD field. |","+| FR-29 | Teacher availability | **FAIL** | The layout and controls are fine. **The slot times show in the browser timezone**: range 3–5 PM, slots 01:00–03:00. |","+| FR-30 | Parent booking page | PASS | Time buttons, the confirm dialog with a note, and \"Booked for Bea: 15:00–15:10\". The seeded event returns 404 for the local parent (child not in Grade 7), which is correct. Minor: a faint grey shape remains from the dialog's exit transition. |","+| FR-31 | Overlap error in booking UI | BLOCKED | No fixture can trigger it in the UI. The exact message text is asserted by QA integration tests. |","+| FR-32 | Cancel booking | PASS | The \"Cancel booking\" button is shown but was not clicked. |","+| FR-33 | Add to calendar (.ics) | PASS | The link is shown next to the booking. |","+| FR-34 | Teacher day view | PASS | Heading, a Print / Save as PDF button, and \"No bookings yet.\" The populated list was not seen. |","+| FR-35 | Calendar \"My meetings\" | FAIL | Not built, because there is no calendar UI (ADR-11 partial). |","+| FR-36 | `/consent-forms/new` | PASS | Markdown Write/Preview, Respond by, linked event, and audience: Course for a teacher, Grade level for an admin. |","+| FR-37 | Consent list, detail and signing | PASS | List empty state. In e2e the markdown renders, a mismatched signature shows an error toast, and a matching one shows \"Consent granted by Polly Parent\". |","+| FR-38 | Change response | PASS | The button appears after responding. |","+| FR-39 | Consent tracking | PASS | Count chips, Status filter, Export CSV, Remind (disabled when there are 0 rows), and the expected columns. Minor: the empty overlay is clipped. |","+| FR-42 | Navigation per role | PASS | Parent, homeroom teacher, plain teacher and admin each see the PRD's entries. |","+| NFR-2 | Overview paint | PASS | Informal check only: every card painted on a warm dev server. This is not a production timing. |","+| NFR-4 | MUI-only look | PASS | Consistent MUI theme throughout. The only exception is the native date inputs on the review-queue filters. |","+| NFR-8 | School-timezone display | **FAIL** | About 10 components use browser- or server-local time. The consent due date shows the wrong day. See the headline for the file list. |"," ","-The other requirements have no UI surface, so they are out of scope for this phase. QA covers them:","+## Minor visual notes (not blocking)"," ","-- FR-1 to FR-8","-- FR-15 and FR-16","-- FR-23","-- FR-25 to FR-34","-- FR-36 and FR-37","+- **Empty DataGrid overlay is clipped.** On the review queue and consent tracking, an empty grid shows only the top of the inbox icon, and the \"No results\" text is hidden. This looks like the shared `DataTable`.","+- **Some avatars have no background.** `UserAvatar` sometimes renders initials with no background colour (`MM`, `PP` and `TT`).","+- **Blank Periods group.** With no bell periods, \"Specific periods\" shows an empty Periods group with no explanation.","+- **Seed creator (QA note).** The seeded \"Science Museum Trip\" is created by a teacher with a Grade-level audience, which the UI wouldn't allow that teacher to create."," ","-## Method","+## Recommended next step"," ","-1. I listed the requirements that have a user-visible surface, using `requirements.json` and the UI tasks in `implementation-plan.json`.","-2. I checked whether each planned UI file exists, and ran `git diff HEAD -- src` and a grep of `navigation.ts`.","-3. I sent signed-out HTTP requests to the :3000 and :3001 servers.","-4. I ran a Playwright driver, `/tmp/uiv-sh14/d2.cjs` (outside the repo, `bypassCSP` per ADR-4), against :3001. It tried to log in as each seeded role, then open `/calendar`, `/account/calendar` and `/admin/academic-years/x` and call the calendar APIs. Login failed for every role, as described above.","-5. I created no fixtures and made no changes to the database or product code.","+Re-run Dev for the NFR-8 timezone fix. It is a small, mechanical change across the files listed above. Then re-check `/conferences/[id]/availability` and `/consent-forms` here."]}],"originalFile":"# UI Verification Report: SH-14 (PRD-14 School Calendar, Events & Holidays)\n\n- **Ticket:** SH-14\n- **Status:** blocked\n- **Result:** 15 UI-facing findings: **0 PASS, 15 FAIL (not implemented), 0 BLOCKED**\n\n> This report replaces the SH-13 report. The SH-13 screenshots in `screenshots/` are left as they were and are also in git history. SH-14 evidence is in `screenshots-sh14/` and `uiv-raw-sh14.log`. `ui-verification-report.json` has the same findings in machine-readable form.\n\n## Headline\n\n**SH-14 has no UI to verify.** The Dev phase finished only TASK-1 to TASK-7, the backend foundation:\n\n- dependencies\n- Prisma models and migration\n- validators\n- recurrence expansion\n- iCal builder\n- audience resolver\n- notification types\n\nNone of the user-facing tasks has code on disk: TASK-13 and TASK-17 to TASK-23. These files are missing:\n\n- `/calendar`: `page.tsx`, `CalendarView.tsx`, `SourceChips.tsx`\n- `EventDrawer.tsx`\n- `EventEditorDialog.tsx`\n- `AudienceBuilder.tsx`\n- `/account/calendar`: `page.tsx`, `SubscribeCard.tsx`\n- `/admin/academic-years/[id]`: the page and `TermBreaksButton.tsx`\n\nNone of the existing screens was changed for holidays either: the timetable Today view, the attendance register, the assignment editor and the quiz settings. `src/config/navigation.ts` has no calendar entries.\n\nThis agrees with the QA report: overall FAIL, with 32 requirements NOT-IMPLEMENTED.\n\n**What needs to happen:** re-run Dev for TASK-8 to TASK-27, then QA, then this phase.\n\n## The environment also blocked rendering\n\nEven for pages that already exist, nothing could be rendered after login:\n\n- **:3001 server:** the `next dev` server for this repo serves `/login` without styles (serif fallback fonts, no MUI theme), and the page never hydrates. Playwright fills the form and the value reads back correctly. The native form POST then reloads the page empty, so login failed for **all four seeded roles** (admin, teacher, parent, student). The `*-error.png` screenshots show this.\n  - A likely cause is that the dev server is stale after the TASK-1 dependency and override changes to `@mui/x-scheduler` and `@mui/x-internals`. This is not confirmed.\n  - I did not restart the server because it is shared.\n  - **Restart the dev server before the next UI-verification run.**\n- **:3000 server:** this one runs from a different checkout (`~/Documents/forge/schoolhub`) and returns 500 for every route, so it was not used.\n- **Signed-out requests:** without a session, `/calendar` and `/account/calendar` return 307 to `/login`, and `/api/calendar` and `/api/school-day` return 401. That is only the auth middleware answering, not evidence that a page or route exists.\n- **Design reference:** there is no `figma-readiness.json`, so the PRD text was the only reference.\n\n## Findings\n\nAll verdicts are **FAIL**. Each surface is missing from source, which I confirmed with a file check and `git diff`. None was marked PASS, because nothing was rendered.\n\n| Req | Surface | Verdict | Notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| FR-9 | `/calendar` (month, week and agenda views, navigation) | FAIL | `calendar/page.tsx` and `CalendarView.tsx` do not exist (TASK-20). |\n| NFR-12 | Default view (month at 768 px or wider, agenda below 768 px) | FAIL | Depends on the missing `/calendar` page. |\n| FR-10 | Source chips | FAIL | `SourceChips.tsx` and `sources.ts` do not exist. |\n| FR-11 | Parent child filter and child-name labels | FAIL | There is no calendar page or sources code. |\n| FR-12 | Event drawer, including the \"Add to my calendar\" .ics download | FAIL | `EventDrawer.tsx` and `/api/events/[id]/ics` do not exist. |\n| FR-13 | Clicking a deadline opens the assignment or quiz | FAIL | There is no calendar page. |\n| FR-14 | \"New event\" button, editor dialog and audience builder | FAIL | `EventEditorDialog.tsx` and `AudienceBuilder.tsx` do not exist. |\n| FR-21 | RSVP controls, disabled after the deadline | FAIL | There is no drawer and no RSVP API. |\n| FR-22 | Own RSVP and totals; full list and CSV export for the creator and admins | FAIL | There is no drawer and no `rsvps` API. |\n| FR-24 | `/account/calendar` Subscribe card | FAIL | The page, `SubscribeCard.tsx` and `/api/me/calendar-feed` do not exist. |\n| FR-35 | Calendar entries in the sidebar | FAIL | `navigation.ts` has 0 calendar entries. |\n| FR-17 | Holiday name shown in Today and timetable views | FAIL | `getScheduleForDate` is unchanged and only has a \"holidays hook in here\" comment. `isSchoolDay` does not exist. |\n| FR-18 | Holiday banner and confirmation on the attendance register | FAIL | The register page and `RegisterForm.tsx` are unchanged. |\n| FR-19 | Holiday warning in the assignment editor and quiz settings | FAIL | `AssignmentForm.tsx` and `QuizSettingsPanel.tsx` are unchanged. |\n| FR-20 | \"Add term breaks\" admin button | FAIL | The page, the button and the API do not exist. |\n\nThe other requirements have no UI surface, so they are out of scope for this phase. QA covers them:\n\n- FR-1 to FR-8\n- FR-15 and FR-16\n- FR-23\n- FR-25 to FR-34\n- FR-36 and FR-37\n\n## Method\n\n1. I listed the requirements that have a user-visible surface, using `requirements.json` and the UI tasks in `implementation-plan.json`.\n2. I checked whether each planned UI file exists, and ran `git diff HEAD -- src` and a grep of `navigation.ts`.\n3. I sent signed-out HTTP requests to the :3000 and :3001 servers.\n4. I ran a Playwright driver, `/tmp/uiv-sh14/d2.cjs` (outside the repo, `bypassCSP` per ADR-4), against :3001. It tried to log in as each seeded role, then open `/calendar`, `/account/calendar` and `/admin/academic-years/x` and call the calendar APIs. Login failed for every role, as described above.\n5. I created no fixtures and made no changes to the database or product code.\n","userModified":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_012PAxdZ5Cf4BF7sPm1QrbEn","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
