d deleted it afterwards.\n- **E2E specs:** I ran the three SH-15 specs against :3201 with screenshots on; all 4 tests passed. They set up and remove their own test data.\n- **Cleanup:** I stopped both servers I started and deleted my temporary scripts.\n\n**Minor visual issues:** empty tables cut off their \"No results\" message, some avatars have no background colour, and an empty \"Periods\" group shows no hint.\n\n**Next step:** re-run Dev for the timezone fix, then re-check the availability and consent pages.\n\nFiles are in `artifacts/ui-verification/`:\n- `ui-verification-report.json`\n- `ui-verification-report.md`\n- `uiv-raw-sh15.log`\n- `screenshots-sh15/`","ttft_ms":1391,"type":"result","duration_ms":1361526,"uuid":"0dd0bd93-b52d-41d9-b8ef-39c4e94999e6","ttft_stream_ms":956,"time_to_request_ms":86,"first_content_frame_ms":956,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0,"model_usage_since_last_result":{"claude-opus-5-5":{"inputTokens":84,"outputTokens":36699,"cacheReadInputTokens":3117345,"cacheCreationInputTokens":234463,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":2.5721840000000005,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":128000,"thinkingTokens":9508,"cacheCreationEphemeral5mInputTokens":220435,"cacheCreationEphemeral1hInputTokens":14028,"canonicalModel":"claude-opus-5-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}}}
